Cell["\<\
Example. (Note, point of closest approach is at the extension of the lower \
segment.)\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.650066749160203*^9, 3.65006674993578*^9}, {
  3.676476280721055*^9, 3.676476281349887*^9}, {3.676476311780918*^9, 
