Cell["\<\
Example. A generic hexagon. Show the circumcenter and circumcircle and the \
Brocard point. Brocard angle for bottom edge is at vertex at {0,0}.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.633535342673539*^9, 3.63353534892069*^9}, {
