Cell["\<\
Example. Compare DiscreteEllipseEquiaxial (red) and \
DiscreteEllipseEquilateral (green).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.671290655402719*^9, 3.671290676062862*^9}, {
