edges on a regular tetrahedron with 3 points and 3 sides specified.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.595802209080818*^9, 3.5958022136001983`*^9}, {
  3.595802828145071*^9, 3.595802831216759*^9}, {3.768662404258083*^9, 
