 StyleBox["tobj",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] takes a TDegree4Vertex3D and returns a rendering of the Gaussian sphere, \
along with additional relevant vectors and planes."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.615298873435358*^9, 
  3.61529888692737*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4132360e-19f7-4320-a7de-\
244f0b020be1"],

Cell[TextData[{
