 ", ",
 StyleBox["opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] takes a TDegree4Vertex3D and returns a GraphicsRow of all three \
renderings: crease pattern, folded form, and Gaussian sphere."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.61529890932789*^9, 
  3.615298924483311*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"172a6f9a-6114-4025-95cc-\
a4ee96fe9b0a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "TwistFoldedFormGraphics[",
 StyleBox["tobj, opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] takes a TGraph2D+TAssigned+TTwistGraph and returns a rendering of the \
folded form with hidden line removal that makes use of information about the \
twist to handle overlaps better than VisibleFoldedFormGraphics."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.61529961378124*^9, {3.615299644261504*^9, 3.61529965830425*^9}, {
   3.6152996921958637`*^9, 
   3.615299729502418*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ad542c52-dcb3-4bc0-8b68-\
79741396d6e7"],

