There are a host of rendering functions in the section \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Tiling-based tessellations.\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
Since they are quite specialized, won\[CloseCurlyQuote]t include them here.\
\>", "Text",
