Cell["\<\
Example. A T intersection, this time with a tolerance. Note that the \
tolerance pulls the intersection point off of the straight line.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.676472180744608*^9, 
  3.676472209334668*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"dcf32d43-cff5-4ac4-b823-\
