Another example. This one has a doubling-back vertex, which would have broken \
the original version that doesn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t drop such vertices.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.643730759356613*^9, 3.6437307754424267`*^9}, {
