b504b524eafc"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "GraphicsToTGraph[",
 StyleBox["obj",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] takes a Graphics object or a list of Graphics elements, extracts and \
fractures all Line objects, and returns a ",
 "TGraph",
 " containing Vertices and Edges. It would typically be used after importing \
a line drawing as Graphics."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.48509170208925*^9, 3.485091740078471*^9}, {
   3.485091790115541*^9, 3.485091827984685*^9}, {3.485091858615244*^9, 
   3.485091914930858*^9}, {3.48509226357944*^9, 3.485092264579403*^9}, {
   3.485092318192624*^9, 3.4850923456541224`*^9}, {3.485092568334689*^9, 
   3.485092578205694*^9}, {3.53368062303432*^9, 3.5336806476474757`*^9}, {
   3.591791262098926*^9, 3.591791306642663*^9}, 3.591895916561888*^9, 
   3.592224370238768*^9, 3.592387031653895*^9, {3.592404693550458*^9, 
   3.592404735801556*^9}, {3.592435852093696*^9, 
   3.592435852184348*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c023fd45-ccfd-440d-8178-\
43446fddc4d0"],

Cell["\<\
Note the error test: if we have a bad edge, we want to make it as easy as \
possible to find the problem, so we' ll print a graph along with the error \
message.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.485093436051228*^9, 
  3.4850934531698723`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f351bb4b-d60e-478c-848a-\
f2d584b34186"],

Cell["\<\
We don\[CloseCurlyQuote]t automatically construct Faces because the graph may \
not be a plane graph. If it is a plane graph and you need Faces, follow this \
call with AddTPlaneGraph (see below).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.593007583215105*^9, 
  3.593007637711812*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a793bf5e-d7af-4e65-86a6-\
da24d9a73719"],

Cell["\<\
Note: if you are importing a crease pattern that has differently colored \
lines and you want to retain the crease assignment expressed by the line \
colors, you should use one of the import functions that will convert lines to \
a symbolic style, such as:
\tCreasePatternToPlaneGraphAssigned
\tCreasePatternToGraph2DAssigned
\tCreasePatternToGraph3DAssigned
See definitions and examples of these farther below, in section \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Crease-Assigned Graphs.\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.533680251673205*^9, 3.533680259232259*^9}, {
   3.533680654014859*^9, 3.533680659558036*^9}, {3.533680921965096*^9, 
   3.533681007959509*^9}, {3.5343436702522993`*^9, 3.534343702857606*^9}, {
   3.592404747505001*^9, 3.59240475127283*^9}, 3.592468075948292*^9, 
   3.5924681842870884`*^9, {3.592828711112095*^9, 3.59282871120892*^9}, {
   3.592828955553701*^9, 3.592828955654436*^9}, {3.593007653327312*^9, 
   3.593007665302347*^9}, 3.594739164303527*^9, 3.59473923586108*^9, 
   3.594739479773589*^9, {3.626367216144176*^9, 3.626367228511189*^9}, {
