Cell["\<\
Note that when chaining this constructor, you must call the function, even if \
you\[CloseCurlyQuote]re relying on the default empty list, i.e., do this:
\ttobj // AddTGraph2D[]
not this:
\ttobj // AddTGraph2D
Most of the time, though, you will have 2D vertex data and so will do this:
\ttobj // AddTGraph2D[verts2d]\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.592649046151081*^9, 3.592649101507053*^9}, {
   3.592649236465539*^9, 3.5926492476171417`*^9}, {3.5926597443034363`*^9, 
