SingleVertexGraph2D is our SingleVertexGraph but with Vertices2D added.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.706828467555984*^9, 
  3.7068284909964857`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"01554463-b4ae-4157-b209-\
