   3.5952867249614577`*^9}, {3.5953350896225243`*^9, 3.595335097548005*^9}, {
   3.595357954927309*^9, 3.595357973437698*^9}, 3.6153032126512628`*^9, 
   3.7067893353133*^9, {3.7222498001933126`*^9, 
   3.722249809647143*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"82ab912e-864b-43f8-8eec-\
2ace0defd7d3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "FoldGraph2DAll[",
 StyleBox["tobj",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] folds a TGraph on all internal edges."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.722249827706653*^9, 
  3.7222498430474854`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"12eeb091-f804-4df1-b9d8-\
f9c46c71006e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Arguments:\n\t",
 StyleBox["tobj",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the TGraph2D to be unfolded."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7222498841664057`*^9, 
  3.722249900136773*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"44b3e1b1-d8d3-4aaa-aea8-\
277219d7d7e5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Options:\n\tStationaryFace \[Rule] ",
 StyleBox["sface",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", the index of the face whose position remains unchanged.\n\tShowProgress \
\[Rule] True | False, whether to show progress and internal structures. \
Useful for debugging."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.722248539983442*^9, {3.722248727638082*^9, 3.722248741877592*^9}, 
   3.7222488281772833`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"ec1e4b4b-abe9-4002-abdd-\
1c45c321a397"],

Cell["\<\
Returns: the new TGraph2D with folded form as property Vertices2D.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.722249847478415*^9, 3.722249858847475*^9}, {
  3.722249964473211*^9, 
  3.722249977248437*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ef726299-b621-42b8-af70-\
55cadd495be7"],

Cell["\<\
FoldGraph2DAll was the original flat-folding routine; it folds on every \
interior crease. The new and improved version FoldGraph2D requires explicit \
fold angles, but that means you can included unfolded creases in the crease \
pattern and they will be handled properly.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.5953581391478167`*^9, 3.59535818310483*^9}, {
  3.5959754563680763`*^9, 3.595975457023001*^9}, {3.706789377041374*^9, 
  3.706789404800005*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e91f0894-2717-43cf-af97-\
1eac20fe433b"],

Cell["\<\
The original embedding should obey the Kawasaki-Justin Condition; if it doesn\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]t, no error will be generated but the resulting embedding \
will be incorrect.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7067894369538307`*^9, 
  3.706789450728239*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5d0ada7e-17a0-45ee-bddc-\
b5076caa0619"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"FoldGraph2DAll", "[", 
   RowBox[{"tobj_TObj", ",", "opts___"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"FoldGraph2D", "[", 
   RowBox[{"tobj", ",", 
    RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\[Pi]", ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"Length", "[", 
        RowBox[{"tobj", "[", "Edges", "]"}], "]"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
    "opts"}], "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.722250045008379*^9, {3.722250080175886*^9, 3.7222501060728283`*^9}, {
   3.722250228257572*^9, 3.722250259289654*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[1349]:=",ExpressionUUID->"36838876-f279-4cca-a41b-d6f3887f2310"],

