Cell["\<\
Example. A folded vertex. Fold it up, then unfold it again. Offset and rotate \
the original vertex to show that unfolding it puts it in a standard position.\
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.595271012675541*^9, 3.595271016273655*^9}, {
  3.595355816628304*^9, 3.595355821104931*^9}, {3.595357804801234*^9, 
