  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["ymax",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "}, ",
 StyleBox["opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "]\n\t(options) AxesThickness2D, AxesArrowheads, AxesColor, AxesLabelStyle, \
AxesLabel, AxesLabelPosition"
}], "Subsubsection",
