Cell["\<\
Returns a list of styled Graphics3D elements that represent the desired arc.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.692462766002984*^9, 
  3.6924627956935*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"364aaad7-f767-4bd4-9db0-db888097920c"],

Cell["\<\
The length of the slice tapers linearly with angle. For simplicity of \
implementation, we assume that the angle is always less than \[Pi] (which \
will be the case in degree-4 vertices).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.692462909462028*^9, 
  3.692462911167995*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"74a73a4a-a535-46fc-9c60-\
b113e68fc3fd"],

