 "Styled3DArcClosed[",
 StyleBox["rlist",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] returns graphics primitives for a set of connected pie slices that closes \
a loop; thus, it can be used for a spherical vertex or for a trace on the \
Gaussian sphere."
}], "Text",
