Cell["\<\
Useful for turning a display pattern into a scored pattern, where don\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]t want to score on unfolded crease lines. You can also \
accomplish the same effect by applying rule CreaseLine\[Rule]NoLine.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.6892475263241863`*^9, {3.689247594511923*^9, 
