Cell["\<\
Returns a list of Graphics/Graphics3D elements that display the ruled fold.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.6914102731205263`*^9, 3.6914102935048842`*^9}, {
  3.691496372255047*^9, 
