Cell["\<\
Example: with types. Note that we must provide an empty list for faces.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.5924227554311953`*^9, 3.592422756173581*^9}, {
  3.592422945686865*^9, 3.5924229488844843`*^9}, {3.59285480282268*^9, 
