Cell["\<\
Here\[CloseCurlyQuote]s a model of the single-step Randlett Flapping Bird \
(based on a model code I wrote in 1991.). This is a variation of Randlett\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s bird in which all the creases can come together at once \
(no sequential reverse folds). The result is a TPlaneGraphAssigned.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.592757110336211*^9, 3.59275713218537*^9}, {
