Cell["\<\
Note that when you import a file, you should perform style conversion (using \
ExtractStyleArgs and ReplaceStyleArgs) to apply our symbolic styles *before* \
you apply CreasePatternToPlaneGraphAssigned.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.485093621022524*^9, 3.485093664363574*^9}, 
