Cell["\<\
Example. This starts with a Graphics crease pattern, turns it into a \
TPlaneGraphAssigned, then uses that to display it back as a crease pattern \
again.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.4850961958879642`*^9, 3.485096196599231*^9}, {
