Cell[TextData[{
 "FoldedFormLines3D[",
 StyleBox["tobj",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] takes an TGraphAssigned+TGraph3D and returns a list of Graphics3D \
elements that shows the folded form using the symbolic styles (apply rule set \
OrigamiStyle or equivalent to render). Options are:\n\tFoldLines \[Rule] \
CreasePattern | None | FoldLine, specifies whether to draw fold lines as M/V \
(Automatic), leave them out, or use generic FoldLine style."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.457626491906258*^9, 3.4576264987674527`*^9}, {
