Cell["\<\
Fold angles of merged edges are set to 0. If you are merging graphs where the \
merge edges are actually folded, you\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll need to recompute or \
manually assign their fold angles.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.70781822371276*^9, 3.707818240713543*^9}, {
  3.707825336331291*^9, 3.707825376170396*^9}, {3.7079117837412376`*^9, 
