Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Notes", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.649951110004463*^9, 
  3.649951110932645*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3d9deb9c-b5f7-409f-a193-\
c0327ce57e66"],

Cell["\<\
These functions join various types of assigned graph in the same way that \
JoinGraphs did, by aligning pairs of vertices in the crease pattern and, in \
the case of the 2D and 3D versions, in the folded form. As with the \
MergeGraphs-like functions, we assume that joining is happening along \
unfolded edges, which avoids various complications, like trying to compute \
fold types or angles, or inconsistent assignments along edges.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.649951113108573*^9, 3.649951127562915*^9}, {
  3.649951303615948*^9, 3.649951451870336*^9}, {3.70776408267986*^9, 
