Cell["\<\
Example: a rotational pattern with the central vertices merged. Observe that \
the corner indices are repeated because the pattern is closed on itself.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.693415114427692*^9, 3.693415131043921*^9}, {
  3.69341532669351*^9, 3.6934153408217297`*^9}, {3.693415806705033*^9, 
