edge.
\t\[Gamma]b \[LongDash] the fold angle for the fold that hits the bottom \
edge.
\t\[Phi]l \[LongDash] the direction angle for the fold that hits the left edge.
\t\[Gamma]l \[LongDash] the fold angle for the fold that hits the left edge.\
\>", "Text",
