Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Notes", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.594754049042403*^9, 
  3.594754049529389*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"79f65ce0-e0de-4c59-abc3-\
fe45210699b2"],

Cell["\<\
These functions compute and display representations of single vertices within \
crease patterns. We separate the properties of a vertex from the visual \
representation of that vertex as a circular cutout from the crease pattern. \
The vertex itself is class TVertex. Its visual representation is provided by \
a TGraph whose boundary is a circular polygon.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.594754051265746*^9, 3.59475408293539*^9}, {
  3.597505933599411*^9, 3.597506003433095*^9}, {3.597510040126789*^9, 
  3.597510062693896*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f04f4d20-f5ee-49c7-9f88-\
6b358ec02fd4"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Class TVertex", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.5949420251104727`*^9, 
  3.5949420273491893`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"66016326-ac28-4380-801d-\
6be1cda6aef9"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
TObj class: TVertex
\tInherits from: none\
\>", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.594942031268736*^9, 3.5949420578507843`*^9}, {
   3.594942252110634*^9, 3.5949422524304748`*^9}, 
   3.595007109249237*^9},ExpressionUUID->"1b5d6a0a-0a89-4480-867d-\
4c29721a2708"],

Cell["\<\
TVertex is a TObj class that describes a general vertex (not necessarily \
developable). It is also used as the base class for the TVertex3D class, see \
next.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.594942076945714*^9, 3.594942124414714*^9}, {
  3.594942263854861*^9, 
  3.594942271268835*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2700ac31-e498-43cb-a8ce-\
88eb1f814fe7"],

Cell["\<\
Although we provide a graphical representation of both the crease pattern and \
folded form, we do not generate a TGraph of it because, in general, the \
vertex might not be developable.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.594755876003923*^9, 3.594755991685108*^9}, {
  3.594942340362823*^9, 
  3.5949423473280087`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"463e59be-5169-4079-ad9f-\
22b02c3ea078"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"TVertex", "::", "usage"}], 
   "=", "\"\<TVertex is a TObj class that describes a 2D vertex.\>\""}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.592437356508765*^9, 3.592437371676598*^9}, {
   3.592829150748508*^9, 3.592829150779587*^9}, 3.593006324758723*^9, {
   3.594942231026743*^9, 3.594942243705453*^9}},
