Cell["\<\
We can now generate a visible folded form. But we need to update \
CircularAngleLabels to space out the angles radially, and add arcs to \
indicate relevant angles.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.628968585553914*^9, 
  3.62896863371063*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d1d79838-44dd-41eb-8204-\
354beaa33483"]
}, Closed]],

