   3.594755834999598*^9}, {3.5949420474596357`*^9, 
   3.594942048484238*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"64e0a224-904a-4100-a77b-\
e6c0ce0f916b"],

Cell["\<\
TVertex3D is a TObj class that describes a 3D vertex, not necessarily \
developable, along with a description in its dual space, the Gaussian sphere.\
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.592437311261001*^9, 3.592437342856331*^9}, 
   3.592829150726448*^9, 3.593006324666823*^9, {3.594942295227784*^9, 
   3.594942298763797*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"53ae440b-c601-4ef4-bf7e-\
48c37963e909"],

Cell["\<\
Although we provide a graphical representation of both the crease pattern and \
folded form, we do not generate a TGraph of it because, in general, the \
vertex might not be developable.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.594755876003923*^9, 3.594755991685108*^9}, {
  3.594942340362823*^9, 
  3.5949423473280087`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b81f6440-1169-4a46-a97f-\
b469857ab259"],

