4de095c05cf8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "MakeTVertex3DFromFoldVectors[",
 StyleBox["foldvectors",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] takes a set of (not-necessarily normalized) fold direction vectors in 3D \
and returns a TVertex3D that describes the vertex, which need not be \
developable. Options are:\n\tOptions[MakeTVertexFromAngles] (OffsetAngle) are \
passed through."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.439841075152116*^9, 3.439841164448566*^9}, {
