Cell["\<\
Example: a degree-4 vertex that forms a mountain-like vertex. Show everything.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.442015282823036*^9, 3.442015283462521*^9}, {
   3.442047694273646*^9, 3.442047696982687*^9}, {3.44204779500963*^9, 
