Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Major-first and minor-first sector angle lists", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.617311266373166*^9, 3.61731128023496*^9}, {
  3.617311365637521*^9, 3.61731136902087*^9}, {3.6173117725556607`*^9, 
  3.61731177304327*^9}, {3.61743428288669*^9, 3.61743428594771*^9}, {
  3.617436020012894*^9, 3.617436021835653*^9}, {3.617436138774581*^9, 
  3.61743615544379*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"dc45cc6a-a98f-420a-b35a-\
ac4b37b40156"],

Cell["\<\
In a degree-4 vertex, we can always identify major and minor crease pairs by \
whether opposite creases\[CloseCurlyQuote] types match (major) or differ \
(minor). In every vertex, we can choose any given opposing pair of creases to \
be major or minor, but once we\[CloseCurlyQuote]ve made that choice, the \
possible crease assignments for the four creases are constrained.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.617311299825672*^9, 3.617311359390018*^9}, {
  3.6173114446109056`*^9, 3.61731145105612*^9}, {3.617311505556772*^9, 
  3.617311524211062*^9}, {3.617436168632818*^9, 
  3.617436175460054*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f3938ae8-e2e7-4891-91c1-\
dad777233798"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "When we provide an ordered list of sector angles to a function, in many \
cases, the output of the function depends on which of the two pairs is major \
and which is minor. If ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "1"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "de326dec-0137-415f-b26c-b6b7b7ff0f68"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "3"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b4230a5e-5720-4f88-a18d-4051aecd6e33"],
 " are the minor pair and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "756809d1-0217-4344-b619-f7218e50b6df"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "4"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "eb593a1d-5736-448f-bb60-a5e9a9a90340"],
 " are the major pair, we will call such a list a ",
 StyleBox["minor-first ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "list of angles. Otherwise, the list is ",
 StyleBox["major-first",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.617311554192939*^9, 3.617311637139955*^9}, {
  3.617311667578592*^9, 3.61731174164557*^9}, {3.617313036236104*^9, 
  3.617313042115586*^9}, {3.617313107807844*^9, 3.617313126390449*^9}, {
  3.617433947288258*^9, 3.61743398240852*^9}, {3.617434292550193*^9, 
  3.617434350758425*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f90c24a6-db60-4d3e-b67b-\
d441407e6ddd"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "MinorFirstStraightMinorAnglesQ[",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
