Cell["\<\
Example: compare flat-foldable, straight-minor, and general vertex.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.594764077117693*^9, 3.594764084820652*^9}, 
   3.5947645396881237`*^9, {3.594764825708284*^9, 3.5947648377961907`*^9}, {
