Cell["\<\
Compare MakeDihedralsFromSectorsAndMajorDihedral and \
MakeDihedralsFromSectorsAndMinorDihedral. They should, of course, give the \
same sets of angles.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.617222812846909*^9, 3.617222827174806*^9}, {
  3.617315798524819*^9, 
