 StyleBox["angles",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] creates a flat-folded strip with the dimensions of the magic routine \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Troublewit.\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]"
}], "Text",
