 StyleBox["p",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the initial point in the x-y plane.\n\t",
 StyleBox["angles",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] a list of 5 angles that defines the shape; each angle is the \
absolute direction angle for its corresponding segment."
}], "Text",
