  3.701857578349253*^9, 3.701857602763411*^9}, {3.701857977824358*^9, 
  3.701858001881587*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"44450b12-d987-4029-9927-\
980076cf3c99"],

Cell["\<\
Returns: A flat-folded strip with that shape. If you feed this to \
RotationalPleats (below) with 14 repetitions, you will get a Troublewit \
pattern.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.701857353386432*^9, 3.701857406099894*^9}, 
   3.701860207356653*^9},ExpressionUUID->"f95fedbc-c525-40ee-8eac-\
