Cell["\<\
Use FoldLinearChain to fold the pattern to a desired initial dihedral angle.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.617404687172445*^9, 
  3.617404719538178*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6dd0a28e-3a47-4096-b9da-\
