Cell["\<\
This is the crease pattern in Huffman's paper. We\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll add an \
arrow showing the axis of cylindrical curling, which we get from the \
infinitesimal tangent vector of the generating vertex.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.443030132150228*^9, 3.443030137579731*^9}, {
