Cell["\<\
Example. An irregular vertex, folded the other direction. Note that the \
valley fold stays a straight line; that\[CloseCurlyQuote]s part of the \
Yoshimura condition that allows tiling of the vertex.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.616164285004447*^9, 3.61616428567474*^9}, {
