Cell["\<\
Example: a slice at the maximum angle. You can see how it \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]kisses\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] the trace from below.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.442791439661147*^9, 3.442791440437097*^9}, {
