Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Strained patterns", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.701255808997836*^9, 
  3.701255813189824*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a6ddbdbf-30d2-4716-8510-\
66766cb44b15"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Notes", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.701255819996439*^9, 
  3.701255820526615*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6bfa3d29-ca9f-46ce-9caf-\
667502c7f662"],

Cell["\<\
For many 3D patterns, finding the 3D configuration requires taking into \
account stresses and strains: either because planar facets need to bend, or \
individual creases have a preferred equilibrium angle that differs from the \
overall configuration. In this section, we build up some machinery that will \
allow the analysis of some simple strained patterns.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7012558222201*^9, 
  3.7012559370239363`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6747689f-8f3e-40bd-8441-\
c47c9ba2fc7e"],

Cell["\<\
The general approach for analyzing such configurations is to set them up as \
nonlinear constrained optimizations, where isometry conditions give rise to \
equality constraints, and a figure of merit (FOM) consisting of the total \
strain energy is minimized.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7012559899262323`*^9, 
  3.701256044703483*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f5ef8b01-f4f5-4b94-a178-\
bf8c94f92e99"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Vertex position constraints", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.701258012158474*^9, 3.701258015782609*^9}, {
  3.702581440388874*^9, 3.702581442748256*^9}, {3.7026631319386377`*^9, 
  3.702663133994369*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"61c93f95-668d-4e68-baf0-\
d9a1a1271033"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Notes", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.701258102694254*^9, 
  3.701258103176744*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"115c5528-cbc9-4d44-af2d-\
1210eb911684"],

Cell["\<\
Generally, to find a 3D configuration, we need to impose external constraints \
that stretch against the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]springs\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] that represent bend/fold energy. We do this in a \
flexible way by creating several types of constraints function that can be \
supplied to the overall configuration-finder.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7012570936866713`*^9, 3.701257218370012*^9}, 
   3.701257271064724*^9, {3.701257363184723*^9, 3.701257441683469*^9}, {
   3.701259413233096*^9, 3.701259416913237*^9}, {3.70163846756703*^9, 
   3.7016384804550343`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8ccc6508-5785-499c-abf2-\
88dee8560b3e"],

Cell["\<\
A constraints function is a pure function that takes a list of 3D vertices \
(which can be\[LongDash]and usually is\[LongDash]symbolic) and returns a list \
of equalities or inequalities that effect the desired constraint(s). Even if \
only a single equation is generated, the return value is always a list.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.701638482783818*^9, 
  3.701638532695614*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"21de7df9-1f4b-49b3-961f-\
e84d571152b0"],

Cell["\<\
Note that the constraints function typically gets called once, when setting \
up the problem. The equations that it generates are typically evaluated \
repeatedly as part of the optimization loop.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.701638585847661*^9, 
  3.701638625296414*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"99611385-8aef-4874-9583-\
6c292e291dbc"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "VertexPointEqualityConstraints[",
 StyleBox["i",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["p",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "]"
}], "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.701257058998823*^9, 3.701257078407818*^9}, {
   3.701257250944568*^9, 3.70125726656876*^9}, {3.701257477977738*^9, 
   3.70125748213729*^9}, 3.701259388063985*^9, 3.70128157755624*^9, 
   3.701281928381424*^9},ExpressionUUID->"820d8494-b698-4067-9579-\
0281a113a4b7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "VertexPointEqualityConstraints[",
 StyleBox["i",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["p",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] creates constraint equations that binds a vertex to a fixed point."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.701257222575521*^9, 3.7012572787374296`*^9}, {
   3.701257484371029*^9, 3.701257486346444*^9}, 3.701259389464826*^9, 
   3.701281577604026*^9, 3.701281928425548*^9, 
   3.701638706997145*^9},ExpressionUUID->"f46fce50-2929-49e1-a503-\
341addc11d53"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Arguments:\n\t",
 StyleBox["i",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the index of the desired vertex.\n\t",
 StyleBox["p",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the 3D point that the vertex is bound to."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.701257321839972*^9, 3.701257347121809*^9}, {
  3.7012574919889803`*^9, 
  3.701257492997823*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a178540f-b394-4357-8af9-\
f7f36bf2cd90"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Returns:\n\tA pure function ",
 StyleBox["f",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "[",
 StyleBox["verts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] that accepts a list ",
 StyleBox["verts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " of 3D vertices and returns a list of constraints equations."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.70125734899247*^9, 3.701257350402164*^9}, {
   3.701257501882533*^9, 3.701257557212255*^9}, 3.701638789851436*^9, {
   3.704223270320725*^9, 
   3.704223270997334*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"019aba52-d4dc-4d6b-817a-\
2e678a11ad41"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"VertexPointEqualityConstraints", "[", 
   RowBox[{"i_", ",", "p_List"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
   RowBox[{"verts", ",", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"#", "\[Equal]", "0"}], "&"}], "/@", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
       "verts", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "i", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "-", 
       "p"}], ")"}]}]}], "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.701257573647124*^9, 3.7012575845247393`*^9}, {
   3.701257628939661*^9, 3.701257754419709*^9}, 3.701259390279844*^9, 
   3.701281577625182*^9, 3.701281928456232*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "In[2612]:=",ExpressionUUID->"f30eb86e-50b1-459f-aeac-a59eb38c786d"],

Cell["Example", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.701257760899795*^9, 
  3.701257761956847*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"35ed7e9d-faa4-44f4-9633-\
079dd3946113"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"vpcf", ",", "x", ",", "verts"}], "}"}], ",", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"vpcf", "=", 
      RowBox[{"VertexPointEqualityConstraints", "[", 
       RowBox[{"1", ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"3", ",", "4", ",", "5"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"verts", "=", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"x", "[", "1", "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"x", "[", "2", "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"x", "[", "3", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"x", "[", "4", "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"x", "[", "5", "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"x", "[", "6", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"vpcf", "[", "verts", "]"}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}], "//",
   "ShowExample"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7012577636494493`*^9, 3.701257952446524*^9}, 
   3.701259391090329*^9, 3.701281577658676*^9, 3.701281928485611*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "In[2613]:=",ExpressionUUID->"a574dc29-1c8e-403e-9c8f-c0ff74de0751"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "VertexLineEqualityConstraints[",
 StyleBox["i, p, r",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "]\nVerticesLineEqualityConstraints[",
 StyleBox["ilist, p, r",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "]"
}], "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.701258064527934*^9, 3.701258090223815*^9}, {
   3.701259391883718*^9, 3.701259392533304*^9}, {3.701259514587973*^9, 
   3.70125951875035*^9}, {3.701259577490171*^9, 3.7012595790268784`*^9}, {
   3.701281577701232*^9, 3.70128157774443*^9}, {3.701281943268054*^9, 
   3.701281943309127*^9}, 
   3.701638364801791*^9},ExpressionUUID->"b3522002-6e65-4d3d-a342-\
780eae29c812"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "VertexLineEqualityConstraints[",
 StyleBox["i",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["p, r",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] creates constraint equations that binds a vertex to a line."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.701257222575521*^9, 3.7012572787374296`*^9}, {
   3.701257484371029*^9, 3.701257486346444*^9}, {3.7012581406174192`*^9, 
   3.701258149727252*^9}, 3.701259046793253*^9, 3.7012593933556128`*^9, {
   3.701259520071643*^9, 3.701259530939289*^9}, 3.701281577791057*^9, 
   3.701281943353047*^9, {3.701638385846842*^9, 3.7016383861904488`*^9}, {
   3.701638676440764*^9, 
   3.701638679912788*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"12083d00-9020-404a-b807-\
d34baea41f63"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Arguments:\n\t",
 StyleBox["i",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the index of the desired vertex.\n\tp \[LongDash] a 3D point \
in the line that the vertex is bound to.\n\t",
 StyleBox["r",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] a vector along the line that the vertex is bound to."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.701257321839972*^9, 3.701257347121809*^9}, {
   3.7012574919889803`*^9, 3.701257492997823*^9}, {3.701258878940688*^9, 
   3.70125891555903*^9}, {3.701259534722121*^9, 3.701259545260499*^9}, 
   3.701259581530488*^9},ExpressionUUID->"61b37f27-a752-4615-99da-\
e6c6e36b6e4b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Returns:\n\tA pure function ",
 StyleBox["f",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "[",
 StyleBox["verts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] that accepts a list ",
 StyleBox["verts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " of vertices and returns a list of constraint equations."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.70125734899247*^9, 3.701257350402164*^9}, {
  3.701257501882533*^9, 3.701257557212255*^9}, {3.701638425167835*^9, 
  3.701638429990671*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6f105244-90f3-4d2c-9478-\
be9cff5c2609"],

Cell["\<\
A note on implementation. We call Normals3D twice, which is on the surface \
wasteful\[LongDash]it would make sense to precalculate it within a Module\
\[LongDash]but because Function holds its second argument unevaluated, you \
can\[CloseCurlyQuote]t use local variables from the enclosing Module. Since \
the constraints function is  not repeatedly evaluated, this bit of \
inefficiency does not cause a problem.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.701261265921556*^9, 3.701261407954937*^9}, {
  3.701638630296139*^9, 
  3.701638634216352*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0c7de9b6-aef1-40c1-9cea-\
65d8732bec2c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"VertexLineEqualityConstraints", "[", 
   RowBox[{"i_", ",", "p_List", ",", "r_List"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
   RowBox[{"verts", ",", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
          "verts", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "i", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "-",
           "p"}], ")"}], ".", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Normals3D", "[", "r", "]"}], "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", 
          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ")"}]}], "\[Equal]", "0"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
          "verts", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "i", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "-",
           "p"}], ")"}], ".", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Normals3D", "[", "r", "]"}], "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "2", 
          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ")"}]}], "\[Equal]", "0"}]}], "}"}]}], 
   "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.701257573647124*^9, 3.7012575845247393`*^9}, {
   3.701257628939661*^9, 3.701257754419709*^9}, {3.701258949660771*^9, 
   3.701258982038493*^9}, 3.701259394162575*^9, 3.7012595222382317`*^9, 
   3.701259583146357*^9, {3.701261147686595*^9, 3.701261260405673*^9}, 
   3.701281577816028*^9, 3.7012819433835506`*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "In[2614]:=",ExpressionUUID->"2c3368f7-030c-4991-a2dc-d5a0104c91ed"],

Cell["Example.", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.701257760899795*^9, 3.701257761956847*^9}, 
   3.701259110336965*^9},ExpressionUUID->"3b1d68b8-c2be-4a39-b23b-\
684cb0fbb26f"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"vpcf", ",", "x", ",", "verts"}], "}"}], ",", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"vpcf", "=", 
      RowBox[{"VertexLineEqualityConstraints", "[", 
       RowBox[{"1", ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"3", ",", "4", ",", "5"}], "}"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", "0", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"verts", "=", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"x", "[", "1", "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"x", "[", "2", "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"x", "[", "3", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"x", "[", "4", "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"x", "[", "5", "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"x", "[", "6", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"vpcf", "[", "verts", "]"}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}], "//",
   "ShowExample"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7012577636494493`*^9, 3.701257952446524*^9}, {
   3.701258997424975*^9, 3.701259002918797*^9}, 3.701259395029471*^9, 
   3.701259523463455*^9, 3.701281577848289*^9, 3.701281943418728*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "In[2615]:=",ExpressionUUID->"208020b3-d40e-45c0-a717-b059381c9abb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "VerticesLineEqualityConstraints[",
 StyleBox["ilist",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["p,r",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] creates constraint equations that binds a list of vertices to a line."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.701257222575521*^9, 3.7012572787374296`*^9}, {
   3.701257484371029*^9, 3.701257486346444*^9}, {3.7012581406174192`*^9, 
   3.701258149727252*^9}, {3.70125904827381*^9, 3.701259059385021*^9}, 
   3.70125939595079*^9, 3.701259527012784*^9, 3.701261514369598*^9, 
   3.701281577896057*^9, 3.701281943464499*^9, 3.7016384090291367`*^9, {
   3.701638648120772*^9, 3.701638648488501*^9}, 
   3.701638698968564*^9},ExpressionUUID->"7feec0c7-5c02-4ba3-97cc-\
f42df1da4c64"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"VerticesLineEqualityConstraints", "[", 
   RowBox[{"ilist_List", ",", "p_List", ",", "r_List"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
   RowBox[{"verts", ",", 
    RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
