  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the index of the desired vertex.\n\t",
 StyleBox["p",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] a 3D point in the plane that the vertex is bound to.\n\t",
 StyleBox["u",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the normal vector to the plane that defines the half-space; \
the vertex should be on the side that ",
 StyleBox["u",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " points into."
}], "Text",
