Cell["\<\
Example. A strained waterbomb tessellation. We start with the analytic \
(periodic) form, then stretch a few vertices.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.701204909153995*^9, 3.701204916681572*^9}, {
   3.701281246734653*^9, 3.701281254735346*^9}, {3.701282276976362*^9, 
