Cell["\<\
Example. This is \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Squaring the Circle\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] (reconstructed for Tessellatica 2). Use \
GenericFoldedFormGraphics because VisibleFoldedFormGraphics takes a REALLY \
long time to render.\
\>", "Text",
