 "] takes an ",
 "TGraphAssigned",
 " and adds class TTwistGraph with a specification of the twist faces."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.592469450541662*^9, 3.5924694958826723`*^9}, 
   3.592828904989094*^9, {3.592829354137859*^9, 3.592829354224905*^9}, {
