Cell["\<\
Initially, hidden line removal when rendering twist folded forms was done by \
the functions in this section (specifically, function TwistFoldedFormLines). \
I have since implemented the more general VisibleFoldedFormGraphics function \
that handles general tessellation patterns including any number of twists.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.485198574664765*^9, 3.485198731680194*^9}, 
   3.592174220712309*^9, {3.59217428739872*^9, 3.5921743463530807`*^9}, {
