Cell["\<\
This example shows what happens when we encounter a poorly-formed twist (in \
this case, it happens to be inside-out, with the twist polygon larger than \
the tile polygon.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.4578328461672792`*^9, 
  3.4578328853527946`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6ac1b0ae-7875-4a4f-8ed4-\
4e981a5f4d3e"],

