78d22842f33d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "TwistFoldedFormLines[",
 StyleBox["tobj",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] takes a TGraph2D+TAssigned+TTwistGraph, and returns the folded form lines \
for a twist-local simple flat twist tessellation. It returns a list of \
Graphics elements that displays the portion of the crease pattern on the \
boundary and in the interior of the twist polygon, with hidden lines \
represented by ",
 "HiddenFoldedLine",
 " and visible lines represented by FoldedLine."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.457688838143066*^9, 3.457688866004368*^9}, 
   3.457732870442992*^9, {3.457733113857656*^9, 3.457733114328442*^9}, {
   3.457737111838955*^9, 3.457737113272958*^9}, {3.48519686615757*^9, 
   3.485196866258891*^9}, {3.592175441884183*^9, 3.592175549107237*^9}, 
   3.59243576123666*^9, {3.5924802936341043`*^9, 3.592480301286684*^9}, 
   3.592828906695679*^9, 3.5928293549219522`*^9, {3.592869841138961*^9, 
   3.592869845273902*^9}, {3.595021640089499*^9, 3.595021651141821*^9}, 
   3.6289485275493803`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"6b932c4c-f6ce-4c06-a07d-\
7e9cce29028f"],

Cell["\<\
Here's how it works. The visibility of all edges is determined by their type \
and by their coverings. All V edges are automatically hidden from the get-go. \
All M edges start out fully visible, but then we apply partial covering to \
turn some of them into partially visible lines.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"191413bd-1a0e-4d35-aefd-c0cfd25c99a0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "To determine coverings, we build 4 lists:\n1. plwedges is a list of pleat \
wedges, whose entries are of the form {",
 StyleBox["i1,i2,i3,ccw",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "}, where ",
 StyleBox["i1",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " is the vertex of the wedge; ",
 StyleBox["i2",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " is the other vertex of the edge of the wedge on the \"inside\" of the \
twist; ",
 StyleBox["i3",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " is the other vertex of the wedge; and ",
 StyleBox["ccw",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " is True if the wedge is part of a CCW twist. A pleat wedge is only \
included if edge {",
 StyleBox["i1,i2",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "} is type M.\n2. pgwedges is a list of polygon wedges, whose entries are of \
the form {{",
 StyleBox["i1,i2",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "},face,",
 StyleBox["ctr",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "} where {",
 StyleBox["i1,i2",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "} are vertices of an edge of the twist polygon; face is a list of vertex \
indices of the polygon;  and ",
 StyleBox["ctr",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " is the center of the polygon. A polygon wedge is only included in the list \
if edge {",
 StyleBox["i1,i2",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "} is M.\n3. pledges is a list of M-type pleat edges, whose entries are of \
the form {{",
 StyleBox["i1,i2",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "},{face",
 StyleBox["1,",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "face",
 StyleBox["2",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "},{",
 StyleBox["p1,p2,t0,t1",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "}}, where {",
 StyleBox["i1,i2",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "} are the vertex indices of the edges; {face",
 StyleBox["1,",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "face",
 StyleBox["2",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "} are the twist polygons at either end of the pleat (either could be empty \
lists), and {",
 StyleBox["p1,p2,t0,t1",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "} defines the visibility of the line with {",
 StyleBox["p1,p2",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "} the endpoints of the line and the visible portion defined by parameters \
t0, t1.\n4. pgedges is a list of M-type polygon edges, whose entries are of \
the form {{",
 StyleBox["i1,i2",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "},face,{",
 StyleBox["p1,p2,t0,t1",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "}}, where {",
 StyleBox["i1,i2",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "} are the vertex indices of the edges; face is the twist polygon it belongs \
to; and {",
 StyleBox["p1,p2,t0,t1",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "} defines its visibility.\nAll of both pledges and pgedges start out fully \
visible, i.e., t0=0, t1=1."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.485196910384027*^9, 3.485196942865011*^9}, {
  3.800014092754446*^9, 
  3.800014108419936*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ca352816-dce6-4b3e-bf3e-\
cf4573dc2822"],

Cell["\<\
Next we perform three types of coverings on the pleat edges and polygon \
edges:
1. Cover polygon edge by pleat wedge
2. Cover pleat edge by pleat wedge
3. Cover pleat edge by polygon wedge\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a2553fdd-bd25-4945-a1a7-3c0287363716"],

Cell["\<\
A polygon edge is covered by a pleat wedge if
1. The polygon contains the vertex of the pleat wedge\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"90e5f305-0ac1-4a1b-9c89-f95c28e76299"],

Cell["\<\
A pleat edge is covered by a pleat wedge if
1. Either polygon at the ends of the pleat contain the vertex of the pleat \
wedge
2. A parity check that depends on the angles between the pleat edge and pleat \
wedge and the direction of the twist.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e71ae4ab-592a-4597-8208-4674ca316e2c"],

Cell["\<\
A pleat edge is covered by a polygon wedge if
1. it intersects the polygon wedge (this is checked by CoverPartialLine[])
2. The pleat edge has a vertex in the same polygon as the polygon wedge
3. The pleat edge does not share a vertex with the polygon wedge
4. The pleat edge is not the leading edge of a pleat wedge whose vertex is in \
the same polygon as the polygon wedge.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.457732996031896*^9},ExpressionUUID->"0ad6e665-e4cc-4622-89d8-\
9b53c4a39729"],

Cell["\<\
Whenver a covering occurs, we use CoverPartialLine to reduce the visibility \
of the cover-ee.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.457732996042519*^9, {3.592869862048445*^9, 
   3.592869862480812*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1cd0e3a2-8b89-4b26-b066-\
97d069c79cbd"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"TwistFoldedFormLines", "[", "tobj_TObj", "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
     "verts", ",", "edges", ",", "types", ",", "faces", ",", "twistfaces", ",",
       "ia", ",", "alledges", ",", "tfaceinfo", ",", "plwedges", ",", 
      "vedges", ",", "medges", ",", 
      RowBox[{"pgwedges", "=", 
       RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"pgedges", "=", 
       RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"pledges", "=", 
       RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", "alllines"}], "}"}], ",", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
       "verts", ",", "edges", ",", "types", ",", "faces", ",", "twistfaces"}],
        "}"}], "=", 
      RowBox[{"GetValues", "[", 
       RowBox[{"tobj", ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
         "Vertices2D", ",", "Edges", ",", "EdgeTypes", ",", "Faces", ",", 
          "TwistFaces"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"twistfaces", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
        "faces", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "#", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], 
        "&"}], "/@", "twistfaces"}]}], ";", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "convert", " ", "from", " ", "face", " ", "index", " ", "to", " ", 
       "lists", " ", "of", " ", "vertex", " ", "indices"}], " ", "*)"}], 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"ia", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"ArcTan", "@@", 
        RowBox[{"-", 
         RowBox[{"Subtract", "@@", 
          RowBox[{
          "verts", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "#", 
           "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]}]}], "&"}]}], ";", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
       RowBox[{
       "converts", " ", "index", " ", "pair", " ", "to", " ", "angle"}], " ", 
       "*)"}],
      FontColor->GrayLevel[0.500008]], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"alledges", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"edges", ",", "types"}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
       RowBox[{
       "create", " ", "pleat", " ", "wedges", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", 
        "form", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"i1", ",", "i2", ",", "i3", ",", "ccw"}], "}"}]}], " ", 
       "*)"}],
      FontColor->GrayLevel[0.500008]], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"tfaceinfo", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"twistfaces", ",", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"CCWTwistQ", "[", 
            RowBox[{"verts", ",", "edges", ",", "#"}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", 
          "twistfaces"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"plwedges", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"#", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", 
               RowBox[{"1", ",", "i"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{
              "#", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{
              "#", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "2", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], 
             "}"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"i", ",", 
              RowBox[{"Length", "[", 
               RowBox[{
               "#", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], 
               "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", "tfaceinfo"}], ",", 
        "1"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"plwedges", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
        RowBox[{"x", ",", 
         RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", "el", "}"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"el", "=", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"If", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"#", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", 
                   RowBox[{"1", ",", "1"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], 
                  "\[Equal]", 
                  RowBox[{
                  "x", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", 
                   "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], ",", "#", ",", 
                 RowBox[{"ReplacePart", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"#", ",", 
                   RowBox[{"Reverse", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "#", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", 
                    "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "]"}], ",", "1"}], "]"}]}], 
                "]"}], "&"}], "/@", 
              RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
               RowBox[{"alledges", ",", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    "#", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", 
                    "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "x", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", 
                    "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "]"}], "&&", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"Length", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"Intersection", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    "#", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", 
                    "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "x", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "2", 
                    "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], "\[Equal]", 
                   "1"}]}], "&"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
            RowBox[{"el", "=", 
             RowBox[{"If", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Xor", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"Mod", "[", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Subtract", "@@", 
                    RowBox[{"(", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"ia", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "#", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", 
                    "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", "el"}], 
                    ")"}]}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"2", "\[Pi]"}]}], "]"}], ">", "\[Pi]"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"Last", "[", "x", "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", "el", ",", 
               RowBox[{"Reverse", "[", "el", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"el", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", 
               RowBox[{"1", ",", "1", ",", "1"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"el", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", 
               RowBox[{"1", ",", "1", ",", "2"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"el", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", 
               RowBox[{"2", ",", "1", ",", "2"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"Last", "[", "x", "]"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"el", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", 
               RowBox[{"1", ",", "2"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], 
             "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "/@", "plwedges"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"plwedges", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Drop", "[", 
         RowBox[{"#", ",", 
          RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", 
       RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
        RowBox[{"plwedges", ",", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Last", "[", "#", "]"}], "===", "M"}], "&"}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
     ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
       RowBox[{"mountain", " ", "and", " ", "valley", " ", "edges"}], " ", 
       "*)"}],
      FontColor->GrayLevel[0.500008]], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"vedges", "=", 
      RowBox[{"First", "/@", 
       RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
        RowBox[{"alledges", ",", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Last", "[", "#", "]"}], "===", "V"}], "&"}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
     ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"medges", "=", 
      RowBox[{"First", "/@", 
       RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
        RowBox[{"alledges", ",", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Last", "[", "#", "]"}], "===", "M"}], "&"}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
     ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
       RowBox[{
       "separate", " ", "mtn", " ", "edges", " ", "into", " ", "polygon", " ",
         "and", " ", "pleat", " ", "edges"}], " ", "*)"}],
      FontColor->GrayLevel[0.500008]], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
       RowBox[{"x", ",", 
        RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"me", "=", "x"}], ",", "mp1", ",", "mp2"}], "}"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"mp1", "=", 
            RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
             RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
              RowBox[{"twistfaces", ",", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"#", ",", 
                  RowBox[{
                  "me", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", 
                   "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "]"}], "&"}]}], "]"}], 
             "]"}]}], ";", 
           RowBox[{"mp2", "=", 
            RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
             RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
              RowBox[{"twistfaces", ",", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"#", ",", 
                  RowBox[{
                  "me", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "2", 
                   "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "]"}], "&"}]}], "]"}], 
             "]"}]}], ";", 
           RowBox[{"If", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"mp1", "\[Equal]", "mp2"}], "&&", 
              RowBox[{"NotListEmptyQ", "[", "mp1", "]"}]}], ",", 
             "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
             StyleBox[
              RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
               RowBox[{
               "create", " ", "a", " ", "polygon", " ", "wedge", " ", "of", " ",
                 "the", " ", "form", " ", 
                RowBox[{"{", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"i1", ",", "i2"}], "}"}], ",", "face", ",", 
                  "ctr"}], "}"}]}], " ", "*)"}],
              FontColor->GrayLevel[0.500008]], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"AppendTo", "[", 
               RowBox[{"pgwedges", ",", 
                RowBox[{"{", 
                 RowBox[{"me", ",", "mp1", ",", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"Plus", "@@", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "verts", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "mp1", 
                    "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "/", 
                   RowBox[{"Length", "[", "mp1", "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ";",
               "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
              StyleBox[
               RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
                RowBox[{
                "create", " ", "a", " ", "polygon", " ", "edge", " ", "of", " ",
                  "the", " ", "form", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"i1", ",", "i2"}], "}"}], ",", "face1", ",", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"p1", ",", "p2", ",", "t0", ",", "t1"}], "}"}]}], 
                  "}"}]}], " ", "*)"}],
               FontColor->GrayLevel[0.500008]], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
              RowBox[{"AppendTo", "[", 
               RowBox[{"pgedges", ",", 
                RowBox[{"{", 
                 RowBox[{"me", ",", "mp1", ",", 
                  RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    "verts", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "me", 
                    "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"0", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], 
               "]"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
             StyleBox[
              RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
               RowBox[{
               "create", " ", "a", " ", "pleat", " ", "edge", " ", "of", " ", 
                "the", " ", "form", " ", 
                RowBox[{"{", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"i1", ",", "i2"}], "}"}], ",", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"face1", ",", "face2"}], "}"}], ",", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"p1", ",", "p2", ",", "t0", ",", "t1"}], "}"}]}], 
                 "}"}]}], "*)"}],
              FontColor->GrayLevel[0.500008]], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
             RowBox[{"AppendTo", "[", 
              RowBox[{"pledges", ",", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"me", ",", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"mp1", ",", "mp2"}], "}"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{
                   "verts", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "me", 
                    "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"0", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], 
              "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "/@", "medges"}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
       RowBox[{"compute", " ", "coverings"}], " ", "*)"}],
      FontColor->GrayLevel[0.500008]], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
       RowBox[{
       "covering", " ", "of", " ", "polygon", " ", "edges", " ", "by", " ", 
        "pleat", " ", "wedges"}], "*)"}],
      FontColor->GrayLevel[0.500008]], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"pgedges", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Fold", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"pge", ",", "plw"}], "}"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"If", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{
                "pge", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "2", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}],
                 ",", 
                RowBox[{
                "plw", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", 
                 "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"ReplacePart", "[", 
               RowBox[{"pge", ",", 
                RowBox[{"CoverPartialLine", "@@", 
                 RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"Take", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"pge", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
                   RowBox[{"verts", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"Take", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"plw", ",", "3"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
                   RowBox[{"{", "False", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", "#", ",", 
          "plwedges"}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", "pgedges"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
       RowBox[{
       "covering", " ", "of", " ", "pleat", " ", "edges", " ", "by", " ", 
        "pleat", " ", "wedges"}], " ", "*)"}],
      FontColor->GrayLevel[0.500008]], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"pledges", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Fold", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"ple", ",", "plw"}], "}"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"If", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                  "ple", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "2", 
                   "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "]"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{
                 "plw", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", 
                  "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "]"}], "&&", 
               RowBox[{"Xor", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"Mod", "[", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"ia", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "ple", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", 
                    "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "]"}], "-", 
                    RowBox[{"ia", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"Take", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"plw", ",", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"2", "\[Pi]"}]}], "]"}], "<", "\[Pi]"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"ple", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", 
                    RowBox[{"2", ",", "1"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", 
                   RowBox[{
                   "plw", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", 
                    "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"Last", "[", "plw", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"ReplacePart", "[", 
               RowBox[{"ple", ",", 
                RowBox[{"CoverPartialLine", "@@", 
                 RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"Take", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"ple", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
                   RowBox[{"verts", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", 
                    RowBox[{"Take", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"plw", ",", "3"}], "]"}], 
                    "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", 
                   RowBox[{"{", "False", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}], ",", "ple"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",",
           "#", ",", "plwedges"}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", "pledges"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
       RowBox[{
       "covering", " ", "of", " ", "pleat", " ", "edges", " ", "by", " ", 
        "polygon", " ", "wedges"}], " ", "*)"}],
      FontColor->GrayLevel[0.500008]], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"pledges", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Fold", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"ple", ",", "pgw"}], "}"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"If", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"IntersectingQ", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{
                 "ple", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", 
                  "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{
                 "pgw", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "2", 
                  "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "]"}], "&&", 
               RowBox[{"!", 
                RowBox[{"IntersectingQ", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{
                  "ple", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", 
                   "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", 
                  RowBox[{
                  "pgw", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", 
                   "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "]"}]}], "&&", 
               RowBox[{"!", 
                RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"#", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"Reverse", "/@", "#"}]}], "]"}], "&"}], "[", 
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Take", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"#", ",", "2"}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", 
                    RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"plwedges", ",", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "ple", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "2", 
                    "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "]"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "#", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", 
                    "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "]"}], "&"}]}], "]"}]}], 
                   "]"}], ",", 
                  RowBox[{
                  "ple", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", 
                   "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"ReplacePart", "[", 
               RowBox[{"ple", ",", 
                RowBox[{"CoverPartialLine", "@@", 
                 RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"Take", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"ple", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
                   RowBox[{"verts", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "pgw", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", 
                    "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    "pgw", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "3", 
                    "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", "True"}], "}"}]}], 
                  "]"}]}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}], ",", "ple"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",",
           "#", ",", "pgwedges"}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", "pledges"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"(*", " ", "output", " ", "*)"}],
      FontColor->GrayLevel[0.500008]], 
     StyleBox["\[IndentingNewLine]",
      FontColor->GrayLevel[0.500008]], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["alllines",
       FontColor->GrayLevel[0.500008]], 
      StyleBox["=",
       FontColor->GrayLevel[0.500008]], 
      RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
       RowBox[{"MakePartialFoldedLine", "/@", 
        RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
              "verts", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "#", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}],
               ",", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"0", ",", "0"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", 
           "vedges"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Last", "/@", 
           RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
            RowBox[{"pgedges", ",", "pledges"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
     
     StyleBox[";",
      FontColor->GrayLevel[0.500008]], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Cases", "[", 
        RowBox[{"alllines", ",", 
         RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
          RowBox[{"_", ",", "HiddenFoldedLine"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"Cases", "[", 
        RowBox[{"alllines", ",", 
         RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
          RowBox[{"_", ",", "FoldedLine"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
   "]"}]}]], "Input",
