Cell["\<\
Here we define some special styles for rendering tilings. As with \
OrigamiStyles[], we give tilings symbolic style names that are then rendered \
using TilingStyle[].\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.457704516419529*^9, 3.457704525618867*^9}, {
   3.457704577500482*^9, 3.457704609928391*^9}, 3.4577136053483047`*^9, 
