   3.629824264416692*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4f14207c-0fbd-489a-9936-\
181d90ab6b7a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "TilingStyle[",
 StyleBox["opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] returns a set of rules that change the symbolic style types given above \
into proper style directives for rendering tilings. Options are:\n\t\
TilingTextColor\[Rule]",
 StyleBox["color",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", specifies the color for text in a tiling\n\tTilingLineColor\[Rule]",
 StyleBox["color",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", specifies the color for lines of a tiling\n\tTilingFillColor\[Rule]",
 StyleBox["color",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", specifies the color for fills of a tiling"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.442605189640786*^9, 3.4426052420742407`*^9}, {
   3.44260541305866*^9, 3.442605511418973*^9}, {3.4426055694953823`*^9, 
   3.442605593493712*^9}, {3.442607714027358*^9, 3.44260772853197*^9}, {
   3.442608488985815*^9, 3.442608541765217*^9}, {3.442622525902917*^9, 
