Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Crease-assigned graph decorations", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.707771417848597*^9, 
  3.707771424744591*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"46b4648c-3674-4985-a873-\
e9efc1d5f6ba"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Notes", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.629846182249175*^9, 
  3.6298461827017937`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ba1a7040-df50-4953-a3e9-\
e3e61c0f508e"],

Cell["\<\
The tiling infrastructure is not inherently tied to origami; it can be used \
to create and manipulate tilings purely as decorative patterns. But the main \
reason we went to the trouble of creating the infrastructure is to easily \
generate crease patterns and folded forms of origami tessellations, when \
described as tilings of smaller building blocks.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.707756294737273*^9, 3.7077563035693693`*^9}, {
  3.707756334682082*^9, 3.707756409987011*^9}, {3.707756451834742*^9, 
  3.707756455515236*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e4702daf-2bb2-4197-9a19-\
62930551e969"],

Cell["\<\
Usually, for an origami tessellation, we are interested in both crease \
pattern and folded form, and for many types of tessellation, the tiles for \
crease pattern and for folded form are geometrically similar to one another, \
meaning the folded form has the same vertices, just smaller. For those \
patterns, we can create both CP and FF renderings using the tiling \
infrastructure by creating a CreasePattern decoration of the relevant tiles \
and a FoldedForm2D or FoldedForm3D decoration of the relevant tiles, and then \
use the tiling infrastructure to combine those decorations with a particular \
tiling.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.707756464314406*^9, 3.707756643293159*^9}, {
  3.7077566777257*^9, 
  3.707756685566127*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1942daca-a67f-471b-af5a-\
d7a7aa631919"],

Cell["\<\
Although it is certainly possible to create CreasePattern and FoldedForm2D or \
FoldedForm3D renderings directly, for most tiles, the way we will create the \
crease pattern and folded form tiles is to create a TGraphAssigned, \
TGraph2DAssigned, or TGraph3DAssigned, and then construct the crease pattern \
and folded form elements by rendering those using the standard rendering \
functions. So, we introduce those three forms as possible decorations.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.629846184842009*^9, 3.62984628551492*^9}, {
  3.62984740658915*^9, 3.629847414738179*^9}, {3.630163294350149*^9, 
  3.630163301929458*^9}, {3.707756660741371*^9, 3.707756728038605*^9}, {
  3.70777220043253*^9, 
  3.7077722343855886`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bc9176d3-9eb0-4e09-be0a-\
d04541c6238f"],

Cell["\<\
There is an important limitation on using the tiling infrastructure to render \
the folded forms, though: since we are essentially placing CP tiles and FF \
tiles on the same underlying tiling, this will only work if the folded form \
of a CP tile has TileVertices that are geometrically similar to those of the \
CP tile, so that we can create a FF tile that is a geometrically scaled \
version of the actual FF that can be placed on the same tiling.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.707756731452711*^9, 3.707756833814445*^9}, {
  3.707756880950814*^9, 3.707756956671294*^9}, {3.707772252776675*^9, 
  3.707772255089362*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3c97b20e-986a-44a8-96c8-\
a79c9c2ca48e"],

Cell["For 3D tilings, we assume the tiling lies in the x-y plane.", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.707772261993697*^9, 
  3.707772276113296*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6130d6cf-07fc-4f00-9af1-\
11d43c9c4dee"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Tiling decorations
\tTGraphAssigned, TGraph2DAssigned, TGraph3DAssigned\
\>", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.707771765355633*^9, 3.707771775076748*^9}, {
  3.707837942454063*^9, 
  3.7078379462623*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a2a56bdc-26c3-4449-8e27-b30d539e5fe6"],

Cell["\<\
A TGraphAssigned, TGraph2DAssigned, or TGraph3DAssigned is a type of \
decoration of a tiling. Embedding a tiling with one of these decorations will \
return a list of that type of TObj class placed according to the size, \
position, and orientation specified in the tiling.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.707771490857081*^9, 3.70777161594781*^9}, {
  3.707771796472149*^9, 3.70777179758088*^9}, {3.707772283945009*^9, 
  3.707772306473962*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d02e2756-bba1-4b56-a3c2-\
f3513ad0fa37"],

Cell["\<\
We will also use the embedding of a single tile with one of these decorations \
as an intermediate step in rendering crease pattern and/or folded form \
decorations.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.70777179985359*^9, 3.70777184006137*^9}, {
  3.707772310240737*^9, 
  3.707772315840725*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"342aa0d9-0853-47ed-a665-\
582669ab5226"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "EmbedTile[{",
 StyleBox["tiletype",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["offset",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["rotation",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["scale}, ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "TGraphAssigned",
 StyleBox[", opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "]\n\t(options) Numeric"
}], "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.707771446385638*^9, 3.707771472793087*^9}, 
   3.707837968503042*^9},ExpressionUUID->"1c856425-a15e-46a9-bd65-\
bedaad1cbad5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "EmbedTile[{",
 StyleBox["tiletype",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["offset",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["rotation",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["scale}, ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "TGraph",
 StyleBox[", opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] embeds a tile as a TGraph with the specified placement."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.707771724806263*^9, 3.707771754908731*^9}, {
  3.707771949845685*^9, 
  3.70777195201394*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3b626bc1-4aca-43ce-86d4-\
761202db9df7"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"EmbedTile", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"tiletype_List", ",", 
      RowBox[{"offset_", ":", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"0", ",", "0"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"rotation_", ":", "0"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"scale_", ":", "1"}]}], "}"}], ",", "TGraphAssigned", ",", 
    "opts___"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"nm", ",", "dtile", ",", "verts"}], "}"}], ",", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"nm", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Numeric", "/.", 
        RowBox[{"{", "opts", "}"}]}], "/.", 
       RowBox[{"Options", "[", "EmbedTile", "]"}]}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"dtile", "=", 
      RowBox[{"RenderTileCache", "[", 
       RowBox[{"tiletype", ",", "TGraphAssigned", ",", "opts"}], "]"}]}], ";",
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"verts", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"If", "[", 
        RowBox[{"nm", ",", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"N", "[", 
           RowBox[{"offset", "+", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"RotationMatrix2D", "[", "rotation", "]"}], ".", 
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{"scale", "*", "#"}], ")"}]}]}], "]"}], "&"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"offset", "+", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"RotationMatrix2D", "[", "rotation", "]"}], ".", 
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{"scale", "*", "#"}], ")"}]}]}], ")"}], "&"}]}], "]"}], "/@", 
       RowBox[{"dtile", "[", "Vertices", "]"}]}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"dtile", "//", 
      RowBox[{"ReplaceProperty", "[", 
       RowBox[{"Vertices", "\[Rule]", "verts"}], "]"}]}]}]}], 
   "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.629764025677956*^9, 3.62976410195436*^9}, {
   3.629816384374558*^9, 3.629816411247642*^9}, {3.629816485378214*^9, 
   3.629816535616368*^9}, {3.629816583415422*^9, 3.629816587837663*^9}, 
   3.629816844043873*^9, {3.630325866600899*^9, 3.630325897478697*^9}, {
