Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Centered twist tile properties", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.4577434164303713`*^9, 3.457743417723331*^9}, {
   3.457922043675967*^9, 3.457922044017687*^9}, {3.461408642944976*^9, 
   3.461408644013864*^9}, {3.533668924652453*^9, 3.533668927724152*^9}, {
   3.5336836982941527`*^9, 3.533683699078156*^9}, 3.627340097634039*^9, {
   3.627340144423834*^9, 3.6273401467975416`*^9}, 3.627340184059816*^9, {
   3.627340216681038*^9, 3.627340219752544*^9}, 3.6273447628773746`*^9, 
   3.627385975622781*^9, {3.628636949214454*^9, 3.628636951098654*^9}, {
   3.628689941908448*^9, 3.628689948433247*^9}, {3.628693013651482*^9, 
   3.628693013898885*^9}, {3.62869306581509*^9, 3.628693068431118*^9}, {
   3.628708773044878*^9, 3.628708774052001*^9}, {3.629839384654131*^9, 
   3.629839418346668*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"86627ee8-6b9f-4e1d-9be4-\
e43adb273fa4"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Notes", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.457721595250703*^9, 3.457721598296111*^9}, 
   3.627385975623251*^9},ExpressionUUID->"d3e24276-9ac7-46e2-bf43-\
014f39fcce7e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This section contains functions that build and investigate tileable twists \
in twist-tileable polygons, which are polygons for which the perpendicular \
bisectors of the sides meet at a single point\[LongDash]which are cyclic \
(circumscribable) polygons. The twist is parameterized by the fractional \
length of the edge subtended by the pleat (",
 StyleBox["w",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ") and by the tilt angle that the pleat makes with the edge (\[Tau]). \
Alternatively, it can be parameterized by the length of the edge subtended by \
the pleat (",
 StyleBox["w",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ") and by the twist angle (\[Alpha]), the angle that the pleat makes with \
the central polygon, since there is a simple relationship between \[Tau] and \
\[Alpha]."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.457722143566229*^9, 3.457722149825455*^9}, {
   3.592170756259306*^9, 3.592170780589327*^9}, {3.627340353624976*^9, 
   3.627340429395031*^9}, {3.627340573495729*^9, 3.627340598672606*^9}, {
   3.6273447443116837`*^9, 3.627344745478757*^9}, 3.627385863692697*^9, 
   3.627385975624035*^9, {3.627387139797648*^9, 3.627387140892967*^9}, {
   3.629977164513114*^9, 
   3.629977203591033*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4c6da874-1e14-4106-81db-\
df4adaca6df0"],

Cell["\<\
In order to generate tiles of the crease pattern and folded form, we create \
TGraphAssigned (and TGraph2DAssigned) objects and then render those into the \
applicable tile. This allows us to use our existing machinery for rendering \
of crease patterns and folded forms (with proper handling of overlapping \
layers) to generate the rendered tiles.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.627556235316399*^9, 3.627556426206181*^9}, {
  3.707838453635393*^9, 
  3.707838455211623*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b791f736-edd6-4f26-98c3-\
0fb5fcf63bee"],

Cell["\<\
Crease pattern tiles and folded form tiles can be assembled into tilings that \
give the crease pattern and folded form where the latter is the folded \
version of the former, except around the edges; our tiles all have straight \
edges, but with a centered twist tile, its folded form actually has a jagged \
edge. We can, though, merge crease pattern tile graphs into a larger graph \
using MonolithicEmbedTiling, then use FoldGraph2D to generate a graph with \
properly handled border edges.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.62755643294211*^9, 3.627556561453767*^9}, {
  3.629977222045691*^9, 3.629977223028785*^9}, {3.707838479513365*^9, 
  3.707838492553155*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8969ce62-be25-4ec2-b15c-\
ac9d80223995"],

Cell["\<\
There is a straightforward connection between tiling-based tessellations and \
the shrink-rotate algorithm of primal-dual tessellations. Twist-tileable \
polygons must be circumscribable, and the central polygon of the twist is a \
shrunken and rotated version of the original tile. The center of \
shrinkage/rotation is the center of the circumscribing circle, and in a \
primal-dual tessellation, it is the vertex of the dual graph.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.627387150276938*^9, 3.627387251790554*^9}, {
  3.627387316713595*^9, 
  3.6273873414491587`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"cfc0648f-4dd7-43ca-8863-\
a4d410847603"],

Cell["\<\
So there is a relationship between the (w, \[Tau]) parameters of a polygon \
twist tile, and the (\[Rho], \[Beta]) parameters of a shrink-rotate \
tessellation, as well as the twist angle \[Alpha]. These first functions give \
explicit relationships between them. Interestingly, the relationships do not \
depend on the specific polygon.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.627387430338531*^9, 
  3.627387574065692*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"120a64a8-f437-431a-a182-\
7fccde6e4366"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "CenteredTwistAngle[",
 StyleBox["w",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", \[Tau]]\nCenteredTwistShrinkage[",
 StyleBox["w",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", \[Tau]]\n",
 "CenteredTwistRotation",
 "[",
 StyleBox["w",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", \[Tau]]"
}], "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.45772302275163*^9, 3.457723024605611*^9}, {
   3.627339665679655*^9, 3.627339665812764*^9}, {3.6273402666203957`*^9, 
   3.627340281591362*^9}, 3.627385863781421*^9, 3.627385975624344*^9, 
   3.627386563946013*^9, {3.6273870410751266`*^9, 3.627387074569665*^9}, {
   3.627393995892432*^9, 3.627394000530538*^9}, {3.628637056174491*^9, 
   3.6286370564565287`*^9}, 3.629839432750751*^9, {3.629839462791451*^9, 
   3.629839474460125*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"413daf70-3740-47a3-8e44-\
52ddd3368c56"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "CenteredTwistAngle",
 "[",
 StyleBox["w, ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[Tau]] returns the twist angle \[Alpha] for a tileable polygon twist with \
width parameter ",
 StyleBox["w",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " and tilt angle \[Tau]."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.457723565263831*^9, 3.457723567361769*^9}, 
   3.627339665951455*^9, 3.627340266715222*^9, {3.62738586386671*^9, 
   3.627385863951888*^9}, 3.6273859756246634`*^9, {3.627386518430174*^9, 
   3.6273865226047716`*^9}, {3.6273865713080688`*^9, 3.627386573122321*^9}, 
   3.628637056599243*^9, 
   3.6298394328500223`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"7d9e85a3-f5e9-46ad-848b-\
77972bbac8f2"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"CenteredTwistAngle", "[", 
   RowBox[{"w_", ",", "\[Tau]_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"Mod", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ArcTan", "[", 
     RowBox[{"w", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Tan", "[", "\[Tau]", "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\[Pi]"}], 
   "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.627339665981518*^9, 3.627340266738202*^9, {3.6273858639742613`*^9, 
   3.627385864000749*^9}, 3.627385975624995*^9, 3.628637056747842*^9, 
   3.629839432874864*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "In[2885]:=",ExpressionUUID->"8d115916-f0f5-464d-9b36-14f34594b4f7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "CenteredTwistShrinkage",
 "[",
 StyleBox["w",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", \[Tau]] returns the shrinkage factor \[Rho] by which the central polygon \
is reduced relative to its tile."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.627387090463797*^9, 3.6273871190792007`*^9}, 
   3.628637056872896*^9, 
   3.629839462890889*^9},ExpressionUUID->"7fcdf128-475f-42fb-9f1e-\
68489e63c97e"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"CenteredTwistShrinkage", "[", 
   RowBox[{"w_", ",", " ", "\[Tau]_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  SqrtBox[
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"1", "+", 
       SuperscriptBox["w", "2"]}], ")"}], "+", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"1", "-", 
        SuperscriptBox["w", "2"]}], ")"}], " ", 
      RowBox[{"Cos", "[", 
       RowBox[{"2", " ", "\[Tau]"}], "]"}]}]}], "2"]]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.627392584289325*^9, 3.627392592447287*^9}, {
   3.627392701759635*^9, 3.627392740295615*^9}, 3.628637057015926*^9, 
   3.6298394629190493`*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "In[2886]:=",ExpressionUUID->"d78cc550-1576-4b8b-8c7a-5457c2127222"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "CenteredTwistRotation",
 "[",
 StyleBox["w",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", \[Tau]] returns the rotation angle \[Beta] through which the central \
polygon is rotated relative to its tile."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.627387384347575*^9, 3.627387405659741*^9}, 
   3.628637057142979*^9, 
   3.629839474566471*^9},ExpressionUUID->"e8840375-4b6f-442d-b44c-\
56be004a6345"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"CenteredTwistRotation", "[", 
   RowBox[{"w_", ",", " ", "\[Tau]_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"ArcTan", "[", 
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"1", "-", "w"}], ")"}], 
     RowBox[{"Sin", "[", 
      RowBox[{"2", "\[Tau]"}], "]"}]}], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"1", "+", "w"}], ")"}], "+", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"1", "-", "w"}], ")"}], 
      RowBox[{"Cos", "[", 
       RowBox[{"2", "\[Tau]"}], "]"}]}]}]], "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.627392792167357*^9, 3.62739279861097*^9}, {
   3.627392876173738*^9, 3.627392892364904*^9}, {3.627393399108475*^9, 
   3.627393430515156*^9}, {3.628294891335763*^9, 3.6282948946296043`*^9}, 
   3.628637057280586*^9, 3.629839474593173*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "In[2887]:=",ExpressionUUID->"73435e04-32e7-448b-b726-20446e64bb83"]
}, Closed]],

