Cell["\<\
Note that there is no guarantee that the crease pattern is flat-foldable for \
an arbitrary tile. Here is a rectangle tile where the twist angle clearly \
varies around the central polygon.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.628690550043568*^9, 
  3.628690593254887*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a8334c5d-805f-4fb1-9488-\
82c45a548466"],

