   3.629465451592577*^9, 3.629837957306782*^9, {3.707838842999352*^9, 
   3.70783884678834*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e56654fc-ba60-42e0-870c-\
48a3971e73d6"],

Cell["\<\
Unlike PolygonCenteredTwistTile, though, the folded form tile graph is an \
exact scaling of the folded crease pattern graph.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.627384115405921*^9, 3.627384193364315*^9}, 
   3.627385975939961*^9, 3.628637075522039*^9, {3.628690125637643*^9, 
