c3bb03421fb1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "{UnitTriangleCenteredTwistTile, ",
 StyleBox["angles",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["w",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", \[Tau], ",
 StyleBox["types",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "} represents an edge-centered simple flat twist in a unit triangle with \
corner angles ",
 StyleBox["angles",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " where ",
 StyleBox["w",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " is the width of the pleat where it subtends the edge, \[Tau] is the pleat \
angle, defined as the rotation angle measured with respect to the edge, and \
",
 StyleBox["types",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " is a list of the form ",
 "{M, V...}",
 " that specifies whether the central polygon creases are mountain or \
