979880d0fd04"],

Cell["\<\
As with the ArchimedeanPatch calls above, in Mathematica 13+, the JoinTiling \
calls throw the N::mprec message, so we have added Quiet to the definition \
calls.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.913540207909691*^9, 
