   3.46229312089755*^9, 3.462293123874579*^9}, 3.465923540054061*^9, {
   3.466099156650462*^9, 3.466099157967948*^9}, {3.533591822830963*^9, 
   3.533591825334433*^9}, 3.5335977581452317`*^9, {3.5336583774067383`*^9, 
   3.533658379838964*^9}, {3.551746363953128*^9, 3.551746364528488*^9}, 
   3.592260801844513*^9},ExpressionUUID->"0064976c-228e-4413-aaf2-\
748c8ac9f52a"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Notes", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.457744215389313*^9, 
  3.457744215811485*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e2a7cb8a-88cd-4879-8cc3-\
e78f932d0880"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Primal-dual twist tessellations start with a plane graph, then construct \
the reciprocal diagram and use the two to create a tessellation for an \
arbitrary crease pattern, using the shrink-rotate algorithm used in Alex \
Bateman's ",
 StyleBox["Tess",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " program."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.461743225891289*^9, 3.461743268630561*^9}, {
  3.461745129162431*^9, 3.461745129288905*^9}, {3.484834755214506*^9, 
  3.484834758843008*^9}, {3.484834798848946*^9, 3.484834799441287*^9}, {
  3.533591842918716*^9, 3.533591845765946*^9}, {3.55174636088203*^9, 
  3.551746361465247*^9}, {3.707753871460185*^9, 
  3.7077538721321926`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"13d188a7-4047-41f0-b984-\
1a98766c2541"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["{\[Rho], \[Beta]} versus {\[Gamma], \[Alpha]}", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.457649416233577*^9, {3.461408709996067*^9, 3.461408713809425*^9}, {
   3.461760919361684*^9, 
   3.461760924449279*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1466be3d-8ad3-4ac9-a9c3-\
13205e0b2b5e"],

Cell["\<\
A shrink-twist tessellation can be parameterized on two parameters: {\[Rho], \
\[Beta]} where \[Rho] is the shrinkage and \[Beta] is the angle through which \
the shrunken polygon is rotated; or {\[Gamma], \[Alpha]} where \[Gamma] is a \
parameter characteristic of the aspect ratio of the parallelograms, and \
\[Alpha] is the twist angle of the resulting twist. The utility of the second \
parameterization is that if {\[Gamma], \[Alpha]} produces a crease pattern, {\
\[Gamma], -\[Alpha]} produces the folded form.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.461760928138771*^9, 3.461760951473152*^9}, {
  3.484834696912684*^9, 3.484834700263784*^9}, {3.484834829417224*^9, 
  3.484834856085051*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c94d9952-b34c-4706-ad87-\
edb78c6224f4"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Primal-dual twist tessellation properties", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.457648732938185*^9, 3.457648734704866*^9}, {
   3.457734203115108*^9, 3.4577342076977673`*^9}, {3.457791853285763*^9, 
   3.457791859012755*^9}, {3.461745240951911*^9, 3.461745241407876*^9}, {
   3.461761586012761*^9, 3.461761588537795*^9}, 3.4659234806502*^9, {
   3.485264390147417*^9, 3.485264391314962*^9}, {3.5517462690070877`*^9, 
   3.551746269583421*^9}, {3.55174650535165*^9, 
   3.551746506303361*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b09256bd-fb32-4a49-9acb-\
7c505f60f768"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Notes", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.4576487585545597`*^9, 
  3.457648758986428*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"43ad63e5-1bad-4939-a631-\
b6e96575d52e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This section defines functions for converting between the shrink-and-twist \
parameters ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"\[Rho]", ",", "\[Beta]"}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"80d63fa4-6d75-4e40-a8df-bbaff5b4c1a8"],
 " (shrink and twist of the primal graph), ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"\[Rho]\[Rho]", ",", "\[Beta]\[Beta]"}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"7db23f61-eb48-42d3-afea-8410b4956418"],
 " (shrink and twist of the dual graph), and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"\[Gamma]", ",", "\[Alpha]"}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"873279e5-fd4b-4a1d-a1b2-73cd99b44c94"],
 " (aspect ratio and twist angle for the tessellation)."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.457648743784931*^9, 3.4576487990716662`*^9}, {
  3.461761241794468*^9, 3.461761254392085*^9}, {3.485264478418944*^9, 
  3.4852644950824423`*^9}, {3.485264677219056*^9, 
  3.485264755057138*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e2c57a75-a8ea-49d8-b98a-\
3d80296d089c"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "ShrinkAndTwistParms",
 "[\[Gamma], \[Alpha], ",
 StyleBox["opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "]\n\t(options) TwistDirection, CW, CCW"
}], "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.4617605320418863`*^9, 3.461760544640529*^9}, {
   3.461760675977535*^9, 3.461760676249104*^9}, {3.461761042187256*^9, 
   3.461761050672342*^9}, 3.59224670960569*^9, 
   3.62878704704226*^9},ExpressionUUID->"8108f827-c365-4c16-9322-\
5dcc6af208fd"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "ShrinkAndTwistParms",
 "[\[Gamma], \[Alpha], ",
 StyleBox["opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] takes a desired parallelogram ratio \[Gamma], pleat angle \[Alpha], and \
optional rotation direction, and  returns a list {\[Rho], \[Beta]} the \
specifies the polygon dilation/shrinkage \[Rho] and polygon rotation angle \
\[Beta] that defines both the polygon and the parallelograms in the crease \
pattern and/or folded form. Options are:\n\tTwistDirection \[Rule] CW | CCW, \
specifies the direction that the central polygon rotates going from the \
crease pattern to the folded form."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.461760667993791*^9, 3.461760702815583*^9}, {
   3.461760792246323*^9, 3.461760875325023*^9}, {3.461760977656213*^9, 
   3.461760991916829*^9}, {3.628722670045485*^9, 3.628722700915026*^9}, 
   3.628787047160531*^9},ExpressionUUID->"3635a3ac-c5f4-404e-991a-\
7ca29487dbcc"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Options", "[", "ShrinkAndTwistParms", "]"}], "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"TwistDirection", "\[Rule]", "CCW"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    "}"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.461761039765694*^9, 3.592246709633078*^9, {3.628722660632811*^9, 
   3.628722662614657*^9}, 3.628787047182085*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "In[3326]:=",ExpressionUUID->"29861b71-ea9b-4fb7-9606-a4f92088759f"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ShrinkAndTwistParms", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\[Gamma]_", ",", "\[Alpha]_", ",", "opts___"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"dir", ",", "\[Beta]", ",", "\[Rho]"}], "}"}], ",", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"dir", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"TwistDirection", "/.", 
        RowBox[{"{", "opts", "}"}]}], "/.", 
       RowBox[{"Options", "[", "ShrinkAndTwistParms", "]"}]}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "=", 
      FractionBox["\[Gamma]", 
       SqrtBox[
        RowBox[{"1", "+", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "2"], "+", 
         RowBox[{"2", " ", "\[Gamma]", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Alpha]", "]"}]}]}]]]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"\[Beta]", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"If", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"SameQ", "[", 
          RowBox[{"dir", ",", "CCW"}], "]"}], ",", "1", ",", 
         RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}], 
       RowBox[{"ArcCos", "[", 
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{"\[Gamma]", "+", 
          RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Alpha]", "]"}]}], 
         SqrtBox[
          RowBox[{"1", "+", 
           SuperscriptBox["\[Gamma]", "2"], "+", 
           RowBox[{"2", " ", "\[Gamma]", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "\[Alpha]", "]"}]}]}]]], "]"}]}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\[Rho]", ",", "\[Beta]"}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.461760995657193*^9, 3.461761030771158*^9}, {
   3.461761065406742*^9, 3.461761106204797*^9}, 3.592246709666787*^9, {
   3.628787047221134*^9, 3.628787047256053*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[3327]:=",ExpressionUUID->"e5c8a9db-df8f-4582-a8de-77f3635631a5"],

