   3.615288952248131*^9},ExpressionUUID->"bb9debb5-131e-4a46-ae9b-\
ec68cc146951"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "MakePrimalDualTwistTessellation",
 "[",
 StyleBox["tobj",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", \[Gamma], \[Alpha], ",
 StyleBox["opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] takes a TPrimalDualGraph and constructs the pair of plane graphs that \
describe both the crease pattern and folded form of a primal-dual \
tessellation. It returns a list {",
 StyleBox["tobjcp",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["tobjff",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "} of TAssignedPlaneGraphs, where ",
 StyleBox["tobjcp",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " is the crease pattern plane graph, ",
 StyleBox["tobjff",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " is the folded form plane graph. Options are:\n\t\
PostRotation\[Rule]PrimalRotation | DualRotation | None, whether to rotate \
the result. Primal puts the primal polygons in their original rotation; Dual \
puts the dual polygons in their original rotation; None does neither.\n\t\
TwistDirection\[Rule]CCW | CW, which specifies the direction of the twist."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.485252525678446*^9, 3.485252539933264*^9}, {
   3.485252596620143*^9, 3.485252713392412*^9}, {3.485252751531749*^9, 
   3.485252753858563*^9}, {3.485253576850634*^9, 3.485253579192145*^9}, {
   3.485263600721698*^9, 3.485263615762266*^9}, {3.533598443671814*^9, 
   3.533598478268374*^9}, 3.551754379268254*^9, {3.592257449008568*^9, 
   3.592257492204369*^9}, {3.592257913206149*^9, 3.592257973126013*^9}, 
   3.592435763664229*^9, {3.592501966985881*^9, 3.5925019776050453`*^9}, {
   3.592502256564064*^9, 3.592502283440387*^9}, {3.592503104438011*^9, 
   3.5925031283140993`*^9}, {3.592828739886887*^9, 3.592828740020286*^9}, 
   3.59282880924036*^9, 3.592828961273939*^9, 
   3.6152889523494673`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"d20dc834-0110-434e-97c3-\
4ce93c0bc4e4"],

Cell["\<\
Unlike other functions where we could compute the CP and FF independently, we \
have to compute them as a pair because we get the Faces of the FF from the \
embedded CP, since the embedding of the FF is not non-crossing.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.592258223734714*^9, 3.592258282280092*^9}, {
  3.592501999323584*^9, 3.592501999850965*^9}, {3.592503142272752*^9, 
  3.5925031444644117`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3458ce74-7b8f-4a0f-b9f1-\
e0707876c8ac"],

Cell["\<\
Note that the choice of the FaceupFace for VisibleFoldedFormGraphics should \
be specified by you to ensure that the folded form display matches the crease \
directions of the crease pattern.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.592260307789579*^9, 3.592260367750896*^9}, {
  3.592260406283735*^9, 
  3.592260408434496*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3b834922-6bb3-4608-b05b-\
67bcb8948936"],

