Cell["\<\
Example. Primal-dual graph, the resulting twist crease pattern, and the \
folded form. Note that we must specify the FaceupFace.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.465918595968738*^9, 3.465918596703989*^9}, {
