Cell["\<\
Example: a patch of a 3.4.6.4 tiling. Use GenericFoldedFormGraphics because \
VisibleFoldedFormGraphics takes too long to compute the overlaps. But \
VisibleFoldedFormGraphics does eventually give the right result.\
\>", "Text",
