Cell["\<\
Example: a Penrose tiling. Use GenericFoldedFormGraphics because \
VisibleFoldedFormGraphics runs into an ordering error when computing the \
overlaps.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.551745236046278*^9, 3.551745239731722*^9}, {
   3.55182884864898*^9, 3.5518288514313097`*^9}, 3.551835707162699*^9, {
