   3.703183839392103*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"feabf7f8-1732-4378-bae5-\
1c3d8d705864"],

Cell["\<\
Note, too, that if we use MakePenroseRhombTilingPrimalDualGraph[5], we will \
end up with some self-crossing polygons in some of the \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]central polygons,\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] the polygons \
in the middle of where pleats come together.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.703186985915112*^9, 
  3.703187036268195*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0ec70d27-99aa-4ede-b8aa-\
f81a98808f30"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
