 ", ",
 StyleBox["boundary",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] does the same thing as MakeChordStarGraph but with a specified boundary."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.462927208710092*^9, 3.462927234187994*^9}, {
