Cell["\<\
This example includes a line segment that doesn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t cross any \
others, a situation that arises for some periodic patterns.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.462809319434148*^9, 3.462809321873283*^9}, {
   3.462809427676667*^9, 3.462809476455744*^9}, {3.533605268078583*^9, 
