Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Radial rotationally symmetric pots", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.594583563843877*^9, 3.594583565900955*^9}, {
   3.594665093637517*^9, 3.594665115026041*^9}, {3.617903647052769*^9, 
   3.617903649771609*^9}, 3.650054132213958*^9, {3.650073026313351*^9, 
   3.650073029073298*^9}, {3.68674553787398*^9, 
   3.686745538583754*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e865b7ea-68d5-4fc1-bc03-\
9e64d98374e7"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Notes", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.6500542425743656`*^9, 
  3.650054243015861*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f1bbd114-68a7-4fed-b130-\
2ac0a4317332"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The rotationally symmetric pots are general structures that have ",
 StyleBox["m",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "-fold rotational symmetry. they can be folded from ",
 StyleBox["m",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "-gons or from rectangles, and their building blocks\[LongDash]wedges of \
crease pattern\[LongDash]can be assembled in other ways to create interesting \
3D shapes."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.650054245021125*^9, 
  3.650054308537589*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bba0d4c8-eaf4-4b0c-a3f4-\
76fee2526757"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This first section investigates \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]radial\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] pots, i.e., where the crease pattern is ",
 StyleBox["m",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "-fold rotationally symmetric, so the paper shape is an m-gon, circle, or \
similar."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.650073037184739*^9, 3.650073063287114*^9}, {
  3.6501122360961447`*^9, 3.650112236670757*^9}, {3.686680888110537*^9, 
  3.686680907127531*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7ae47958-835b-4a70-a48a-\
000ab54b0f6a"],

Cell["\<\
There are two common classes of such shape: \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]thin-flange\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] and \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]thick-flange\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]. The full pattern \
is built up from a single wedge of the 3D form (which, for \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Round\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] pots, is also a wedge of \
the crease pattern).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.6866809117193832`*^9, 3.68668097469911*^9}, {
  3.686681026289229*^9, 
  3.686681111755083*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ea891f79-cc62-420c-a5b4-\
9f8d0895246a"],

Cell["\<\
We index the points of a wedge as follows. First, for thin-flange patterns. \
Left to right: crease pattern, 3D folded form, and a cross section of the \
folded form, viewed from +z.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.6866810709581633`*^9, {3.6866811154429493`*^9, 
   3.686681118650226*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3a5ef962-3e1b-44e4-a201-\
febc92bb5310"],

Cell[GraphicsData["PDF", "\<\
