Cell["\<\
In this example, the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]flange\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
(point d) points CCW viewed from the top. There is also a solution in which \
the flanges point CW and points e, rather than b, have the mountain fold.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.686681221195606*^9, 
  3.686681265008723*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5d141389-4bb5-4aab-b9b8-\
6d44456507cc"],

Cell["\<\
For symmetric thick wedges, we use this indexing/labeling scheme. This is \
general (letters a\[Dash]f), so that the preceding is a special case (which \
is why some of the letters aren\[CloseCurlyQuote]t used in the above). Left \
to right: crease pattern, 3D folded form, and a cross section of the folded \
form, viewed from +z.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.6866793825548353`*^9, 3.686679413990039*^9}, {
  3.68667956611609*^9, 3.686679567140637*^9}, {3.686681162248949*^9, 
  3.686681190237921*^9}, {3.686681908536482*^9, 
  3.6866819842282467`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"599e8027-949b-44a6-b996-\
50dab153b329"],

