Cell["\<\
Example. Downward-facing ellipsoid, moderately quantized. Also report the \
PotWedgeJoinVertices, the indices of the vertices along the two edges.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.6500716338265553`*^9, 3.650071644792972*^9}, {
  3.650072236107356*^9, 3.65007224645902*^9}, {3.650072960598333*^9, 
