Cell["\<\
Same thing, but trimmed and with smooth flanges. \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Smooth flanges\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] means that the \
interior flange folds are shown as unfolded. The 3D folded form is still \
shown faceted, but in practice, the flanges will have to take on some \
smoothly curved shape and it won\[CloseCurlyQuote]t look precisely like this.\
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.687016542319866*^9, 3.687016547796467*^9}, {
