Cell["\<\
Example. A flat-topped ellipse, with tiny twist extension (if it\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s too much, the pleat lines cross). Also suppress the \
cylindrical folds.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.671362860806659*^9, 3.671362867014082*^9}, {
