Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Twist-joined tubes", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.671362084109956*^9, 
  3.6713620897323728`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0a8c0adf-0cfb-443d-bf54-\
b01b26f263cb"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Notes", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.675366098980069*^9, 
  3.6753660998571243`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6b7d6599-d4ff-4e19-b1ab-\
3fde2365aeb8"],

Cell["\<\
It is possible to join two tubes of equal perimeter with a generalized twist \
fold, even if the tubes have different cross section and/or are offset \
laterally from one another. The functions in this section allow the creation \
of junctions between pairs of tubes.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.675366103866974*^9, 
  3.675366156485795*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"179c6bb6-31b8-4ceb-aeb0-\
046c445b5acf"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "TwistJoinedTubeGraphics[",
 StyleBox["botpts2d",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["toppts2d",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "]\n\t(options) TwistDirection, Options[Graphics]"
}], "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.671243605296077*^9, 3.671243618843409*^9}, 
   3.671290947786048*^9, {3.671528358950732*^9, 3.671528366638109*^9}, {
   3.673101662338475*^9, 3.673101674616701*^9}, {3.6753556912242103`*^9, 
   3.675355694690493*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7ddead82-56a5-4aa2-a876-\
c416e6e19498"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "TwistJoinedTubeGraphics[",
 StyleBox["botpts2d",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["toppts2d",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] creates a Graphics rendering of a top view of what a twist tube joint \
would look like for the given sets of bottom and top points. Arguments are:\n\
\t",
 StyleBox["botpts2d",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] a list of 2D points that traces the bottom tube cross section \
in the ",
 StyleBox["x-y",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " plane\n\t",
 StyleBox["toppts2d",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] a list of 2D points that traces the top tube cross section in \
the ",
 StyleBox["x-y",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " plane\nOptions are:\n\tTwistDirection \[Rule] CCW | CW, specifies which \
direction the twist quadrilaterals are triangulated.\n\tOptions[Graphics] are \
passed through.\nIt returns a Graphics object showing the two cross sections \
and the fold lines. Bottom curve is outlined in Red; top curve is outlined in \
Green; and the twist pleats are translucent to show overlaps."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.671243660508953*^9, 3.671243748265405*^9}, {
   3.6712465791044188`*^9, 3.671246612120455*^9}, 3.671290947836775*^9, {
   3.673101662367955*^9, 3.6731016741151657`*^9}, 3.675329991503112*^9, {
   3.675330137533669*^9, 
