Cell["\<\
Example: an offset cylinder, no overlap. Use TypeMinimumAngle option to make \
the fold lines on the cylinders in unfolded style. Note that because the \
twist folds are flat, crease assignment in the twisted region is arbitrary.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.671179378580347*^9, 3.671179379315285*^9}, {
  3.671179476269991*^9, 3.67117948130822*^9}, {3.671361833325445*^9, 
