Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "RecoverCurve2DSystemOld[\[Kappa], ",
 StyleBox["opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] [DEPRECATED]\nRecoverCurve2DSystemOld[\[Kappa], ",
 StyleBox["v",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] [DEPRECATED]\n\t(options) InitialPosition2D, InitialTangentVector2D, \
Simplification, Assumptions"
}], "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.690970802006552*^9, 3.690970853941578*^9}, {
   3.690970934337265*^9, 3.690970946282069*^9}, {3.690971121318671*^9, 
   3.690971128964715*^9}, 3.690988444482687*^9, {3.691164545765822*^9, 
   3.691164558304357*^9}, {3.691182773176443*^9, 3.691182773210446*^9}, {
   3.69125261331153*^9, 3.691252613350728*^9}, {3.6916963123992777`*^9, 
   3.691696326426918*^9}, 3.691697514223765*^9, 3.691697988327023*^9, 
   3.691698253111393*^9, 3.691921636557493*^9, 3.691921671285848*^9, {
   3.799489803231147*^9, 3.7994898217215014`*^9}, {3.800461009935654*^9, 
   3.800461009952106*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e4128066-5297-4670-ac27-\
8dd676143d14"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "RecoverCurve2DSystemOld[\[Kappa], ",
 StyleBox["v",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] constructs a 2D curve from its signed (left) curvature and curve speed. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.690970877159718*^9, 3.690971036930356*^9}, {
   3.690971094765877*^9, 3.690971173216427*^9}, {3.690975305260523*^9, 
   3.690975334452278*^9}, 3.6909894047019243`*^9, 3.690990056592867*^9, {
   3.690990092995672*^9, 3.690990093193115*^9}, 3.691164331208917*^9, {
   3.691167986844824*^9, 3.691168019380842*^9}, {3.691182773243928*^9, 
   3.691182797777209*^9}, {3.691235552167171*^9, 3.69123559263482*^9}, 
   3.69123563658984*^9, 3.691252613391787*^9, 3.6912567736257677`*^9, 
   3.800461009973811*^9},ExpressionUUID->"553eca65-da09-4b86-ba21-\
7c79480b4496"],

Cell["\<\
Arguments:
\[Kappa] \[LongDash] the left curvature, as a pure function
v \[LongDash] the curve speed, as a pure function\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.6912355603147306`*^9, 3.691235566152215*^9}, {
  3.691235661221955*^9, 3.691235662512047*^9}, {3.691256677098882*^9, 
  3.691256691638053*^9}, {3.6912567432286158`*^9, 
  3.691256745245224*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9b809d70-4c15-403d-8ce0-\
88d363f78c4e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Options:\n\tInitialPosition2D \[Rule] ",
 StyleBox["c0",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", specifies the initial (t=0) position of the curve.\n\t\
InitialTangentVector2D \[Rule] ",
 StyleBox["t0",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", specifies the initial tangent direction of the curve as a unit vector.\n\t\
Simplification \[Rule] None | Simplify | FullSimplify, specifies the level of \
simplification of intermediate results.\n\tAssumptions \[Rule] ",
 StyleBox["list",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", assumptions that should be passed to Simplify or FullSimplify."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.691235065551579*^9, 3.691235071734006*^9}, {
   3.691235123137779*^9, 3.691235148876122*^9}, {3.691235664219194*^9, 
   3.6912356648227*^9}, {3.691696354142725*^9, 3.6916963964564757`*^9}, {
   3.6916967872943177`*^9, 3.6916967876341476`*^9}, 3.691697514251375*^9, {
   3.691697597209193*^9, 3.69169762262678*^9}, {3.6916979883579497`*^9, 
   3.691698005633368*^9}, 3.691698253142771*^9, 3.691921636608643*^9, 
   3.6919216713298798`*^9, 
   3.691921758889015*^9},ExpressionUUID->"f931de97-4692-46f2-8d6a-\
709ff0bc20df"],

Cell["\<\
Returns: a list of rules giving the differential geometry functions of the \
curve.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.6912355957447166`*^9, 3.691235643570951*^9}, 
   3.691696502777658*^9},ExpressionUUID->"a7040ddd-aae6-4c20-9f74-\
db597965ff82"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "RecoverCurve2DSystemOld[\[Kappa], ",
 StyleBox["opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] constructs a 2D unit-speed curve as a pure function from its signed \
(left) curvature."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.691164313050246*^9, 3.691164336142476*^9}, 
   3.691182773282259*^9, 3.691252613430112*^9, 
   3.800461009995232*^9},ExpressionUUID->"3720141a-9743-42c4-81a9-\
eea9c7573313"],

Cell["\<\
We solve the system by sequential direct integration, which seems to give \
analytic solutions in more circumstances than integrating the matrix \
differential system.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.69125865768077*^9, 
  3.691258685929784*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"cf06e4ca-0a89-42b2-b5da-\
d8d47a9baf59"],

Cell["\<\
Related to that: doing the integrations via indefinite integration seems to \
be much faster in Mathematica, so we try indefinite integration first. But if \
that gives an answer that contains Integrate, that tells us the indefinite \
integral was unsuccessful, and our subsequent attempt to apply initial \
conditions will fail. So we will instead do a definite integral, which will \
likely still return an expression containing a symbolic integration, but at \
least it will return something.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.693743313729665*^9, 
  3.693743426113435*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5e333a67-5b71-4c8b-8031-\
0a215e0c94db"],

Cell["\<\
Note, though, that many curve speed functions do not allow for tractable \
integrations, so choose wisely.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.690975339465928*^9, 3.6909753763186197`*^9}, {
   3.691258692019324*^9, 3.691258708007128*^9}, 
   3.693743311377453*^9},ExpressionUUID->"861c3afe-6003-4a5f-807e-\
8f897f7a1f67"],

