   3.689076042045289*^9, 3.689076047340108*^9}, {3.689077480944121*^9, 
   3.689077514334303*^9}, 3.689247644572665*^9, 3.691252690873562*^9, 
   3.691505296922229*^9, {3.7995230954830713`*^9, 3.79952310734601*^9}, {
   3.799834684404992*^9, 3.799834684430319*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[3710]:=",ExpressionUUID->"d191a89e-cda0-4206-b8f0-3016c583bc7a"],

Cell["\<\
Example. Right-handed helix. Add a gray disk in the x-y plane to emphasize \
the helicity.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.6689833597740397`*^9, 3.6689833662195187`*^9}, 
