 "} \[LongDash] the domain of plotting."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.800647813483791*^9, 
  3.800647839187594*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3da0c279-0c6f-4485-b714-\
db14a761ab27"],

Cell["\<\
Options:
\tFrenetRibbonWidth \[LongDash] the distance along the two vectors to extend \
the ribbon.
\tOptions[FunctionInterpolation], Options[StyledCurve], \
Options[StyledRuledPatch], Options[MakeShadow], Options[Graphics3D]are passed \
through.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8006478412203836`*^9, 3.8006478730919733`*^9}, {
   3.8006479111640778`*^9, 3.800647927228615*^9}, 3.800647997564724*^9, {
   3.803913165462525*^9, 
   3.803913177036094*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e91d36af-8335-4a03-8d84-\
c0746ed95a0c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Returns: a list {",
 StyleBox["gb",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["gn",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "} of Graphics3D objects displaying the binormal and normal vector ribbons."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.800647929260221*^9, 
  3.800647951836486*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8013ba4c-4c4f-4e88-bc18-\
9da67bb4f831"],

