   3.7995232333721857`*^9}, {3.800014452322001*^9, 
   3.800014453084787*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"dd898ece-cc9f-48d1-9965-\
c1fbcdd1ecd3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Arguments are:\n\ts \[LongDash] the surface function, as a vector-valued \
function taking two arguments.\n\t",
 StyleBox["u",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the surface normal direction vector, as a vector-valued \
function taking two arguments.\n\t{",
 StyleBox["u0",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["u1",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "} \[LongDash] the domain of the first argument of ",
 StyleBox["s",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ".\n\t{",
 StyleBox["v0",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["v1",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "} \[LongDash] the domain of the second argument of ",
 StyleBox["s",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.691282570549293*^9, 3.6912826209163637`*^9}, {
  3.691284805259028*^9, 3.691284820041588*^9}, {3.799523187481942*^9, 
  3.79952323338943*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2f85d319-7fc0-4c5e-9343-\
a7f65ba29855"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Options:\n\tNormalVectorLength \[Rule] ",
 StyleBox["nvl",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", specifies the lengths of the vectors. Use negative number to reverse \
orientation.\n\tGridDivisions \[Rule] {",
 StyleBox["nu",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["nv",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "}, specifies number of divisions in the u and v directions.\n\t\
SurfaceColorFunction \[Rule] Automatic | ",
 StyleBox["f",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "[",
 StyleBox["u",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["v",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "], specifies the color to use at position {",
 StyleBox["u",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["v",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "}.\n\tOptions[StyledVector] are passed through."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.691282625337624*^9, 3.691282810626891*^9}, {
   3.691282844761531*^9, 3.69128285667592*^9}, {3.691283205553375*^9, 
