   3.797957836906071*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f60ec69d-c4b1-493a-9e20-\
b6162748e6eb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Arguments:\n\t",
 StyleBox["s",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] a pure function on two variables that gives the parameterized \
surface in 3D."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.691241659390561*^9, 3.691241661719365*^9}, 
   3.781969284470765*^9},ExpressionUUID->"ab801bc0-61b9-4ea2-8dc7-\
615c5c79d0ba"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Options:\n\tSurfaceOrientation \[Rule] \[PlusMinus]1, specifies the \
orientation of the normal.\n\tSimplification \[Rule] None | Simplify | \
FullSimplify, specifies the level of simplification of intermediate results.\n\
\tAssumptions \[Rule] ",
 StyleBox["list",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", assumptions that should be passed to Simplify or FullSimplify."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.691235065551579*^9, 3.691235071734006*^9}, {
   3.691235123137779*^9, 3.691235148876122*^9}, {3.691235664219194*^9, 
   3.6912356648227*^9}, {3.691241735558269*^9, 3.691241736473103*^9}, {
   3.797258018647421*^9, 3.797258038590842*^9}, 
   3.797258079797508*^9},ExpressionUUID->"96c6ef4e-85aa-4d02-8c5b-\
ea443b189e77"],

Cell["\<\
Returns: the surface normal vector defined from the parameterization as a \
vector-valued pure function.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.691241678438743*^9, 3.691241707175375*^9}, {
  3.691281470946328*^9, 
  3.691281472438453*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"85f8446a-d23c-490e-bc17-\
