 StyleBox["opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] returns a styled Graphics3D element that displays an empty Gaussian \
sphere."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.703967936089361*^9, 3.703967965441419*^9}, {
   3.703976045469149*^9, 3.7039760561386356`*^9}, {3.800002438239589*^9, 
