   3.694219293830091*^9, 
   3.694219340565438*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d04788c0-98c0-479a-9f1a-\
085e67213188"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Arguments:\n\t",
 StyleBox["c",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] a pure function that gives the arbitrary-speed 3D space curve.\
\n\t",
 StyleBox["u",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] a pure function that gives the 3D surface normal vector along \
the curve, same parameterization."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.691575244236062*^9, 
  3.691575246017494*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9342ad8b-b1f0-42eb-a32d-\
c158629e5743"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Options:\n\tInitialPosition2D \[Rule] ",
 StyleBox["c0",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", specifies the initial (",
 StyleBox["t",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "=0) position of the curve.\n\tInitialTangentVector2D \[Rule] ",
 StyleBox["t0",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", specifies the initial tangent direction of the curve as a unit vector.\n\t\
Simplification \[Rule] None | Simplify | FullSimplify, specifies the level of \
simplification of intermediate results.\n\tAssumptions \[Rule] ",
 StyleBox["list",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", assumptions that should be passed to Simplify or FullSimplify."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.691235065551579*^9, 3.691235071734006*^9}, {
