   3.800461197014555*^9},ExpressionUUID->"47bc863e-c1d2-4d59-bc60-\
fa7ecea0b8af"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "MatchCurvesPair[",
 StyleBox["c",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["cc",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", \[Psi], \[Sigma]",
 StyleBox[", opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] takes a 2D curve and a space curve and creates a description of the 2D \
and 3D forms of one of the two developable surface that matches both curves (\
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]gluing a 2D curve to a space curve\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote])."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.688069465358034*^9, 3.688069498336182*^9}, {
   3.688069714287931*^9, 3.688069718383215*^9}, {3.688069856154915*^9, 
   3.688069942784526*^9}, {3.688070263196209*^9, 3.688070272075012*^9}, {
   3.688073205014867*^9, 3.688073275522066*^9}, {3.688138768032097*^9, 
   3.688138857738504*^9}, 3.691184549046768*^9, 3.691252859017935*^9, 
   3.691535987471221*^9, {3.691536201059332*^9, 3.691536271453562*^9}, 
   3.691538188176626*^9, {3.69153839459167*^9, 3.691538395250861*^9}, 
   3.799416232547166*^9, {3.79941627518771*^9, 3.7994162797147827`*^9}, 
   3.799416605330105*^9, 3.800226894541934*^9, {3.800226944346107*^9, 
   3.800226966943349*^9}, 3.800227003030821*^9, 
   3.8004611970318623`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"650c4c5c-02d5-4f64-946d-\
a6f67589ffa3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Arguments:\n\t",
 StyleBox["c",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] a 2D curve that is to be glued to the 3D space curve,  as a \
pure function.\n\t",
 StyleBox["cc",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the 3D space curve, as a pure function, which should have the \
same curve speed as the c.\n\t\[Psi] \[LongDash] specifies the sign of the \
Frenet-Darboux angle, should be \[PlusMinus]1, which specifies which \
solution.\n\t\[Sigma] \[LongDash] the desired orientation of the ruled \
parameterization."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.6915360154908113`*^9, 3.6915360867199173`*^9}, {
   3.799416282146682*^9, 3.7994162930905027`*^9}, {3.799416889966442*^9, 
   3.799416906558213*^9}, 3.800226944357229*^9, {3.800226975953881*^9, 
   3.800226986689664*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8f5aa972-e718-4d0c-a38c-\
401926da3749"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Options:\n\tSimplification \[Rule] None | Simplify | FullSimplify, \
specifies the level of simplification of intermediate results.\n\tAssumptions \
\[Rule] ",
 StyleBox["list",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", assumptions that should be passed to Simplify or FullSimplify.\n\t\
Options[DSolve] are passed through."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.691235065551579*^9, 3.691235071734006*^9}, {
  3.691235123137779*^9, 3.691235148876122*^9}, {3.799416295146799*^9, 
  3.799416301418272*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"24a5f9fc-c2c8-4adf-aa40-\
0be3a9ac3d67"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Returns a list {b, ",
 StyleBox["d",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["bb",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["dd",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "} giving the ruled parameterization in 2D and 3D."
}], "Text",
