   3.799416232547166*^9, {3.79941627518771*^9, 3.7994162797147827`*^9}, 
   3.799416605330105*^9, 3.799418786907473*^9, 3.800226894621889*^9, 
   3.800226944387791*^9, 3.800227067180182*^9, 
   3.800461197113072*^9},ExpressionUUID->"4499a37c-c494-4bb0-aba6-\
74df42695370"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Arguments:\n\t",
 StyleBox["c",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] a 2D curve that is to be glued to the 3D space curve,  as a \
pure function.\n\t",
 StyleBox["cc",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the 3D space curve, as a pure function, which should have the \
same curve speed as the c.\n\t\[Psi] \[LongDash] specifies the sign of the \
Frenet-Darboux angle, should be \[PlusMinus]1, which specifies which solution \
to take.\n\t{",
 StyleBox["u0",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["u1",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "} \[LongDash] the domain of interpolation."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.6915360154908113`*^9, 3.6915360867199173`*^9}, {
   3.799416282146682*^9, 3.7994162930905027`*^9}, {3.799416889966442*^9, 
   3.799416906558213*^9}, {3.799418791179575*^9, 3.799418798875467*^9}, {
   3.800212481866541*^9, 3.80021248321926*^9}, 
   3.800226944398209*^9},ExpressionUUID->"ed035a10-4ead-4bb5-aea1-\
1d06e84877b5"],

Cell["\<\
Options:
\tOptions[NDSolve] and Options[FunctionInterpolation] are passed through.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.691235065551579*^9, 3.691235071734006*^9}, {
  3.691235123137779*^9, 3.691235148876122*^9}, {3.799416295146799*^9, 
