Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Constant-width ribbon functions", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.799570029229227*^9, 3.799570032626981*^9}, {
  3.799604538820153*^9, 
  3.79960453957924*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c772be7d-2a7f-4b07-aad8-\
9066dd37f3e7"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Notes", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.799572565027029*^9, 
  3.79957256565864*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"dd0aa201-f85a-4947-b8e4-\
6df7e74b99c9"],

Cell["\<\
The functions NearConstantWidthScale and NNearConstantWidthScale provide \
functions that give scaling factors for ruled parameterizations that  scale \
the director to provide a near constant width. It\[CloseCurlyQuote]s only \
exact for straight ribbons, but is useful for visualization.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.799572568458402*^9, 
  3.7995726583873043`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"32d61cc4-f382-47a7-94a9-\
5f3ad2e990b9"],

Cell["\<\
TBD for the future: implement the numerical version that gives exact \
constant-width scaling.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.799572661447432*^9, 
  3.7995726765910053`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ef8f0831-94d7-4cae-9df4-\
17a00329d103"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "NearConstantWidthScale[",
 StyleBox["b",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["d",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["opts",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "]\n\t(options) Simplification, Assumptions"
}], "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.799570037027824*^9, 3.79957007372336*^9}, {
  3.799570173931532*^9, 3.799570175013793*^9}, {3.799570276423692*^9, 
