 " \[LongDash] a directrix as a pure function.\n\t",
 StyleBox["d",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] a director as a pure function.\n\t{u0, u1} \[LongDash] the \
domain of interpolation."
}], "Text",
