   3.799332506695383*^9}, {3.799335590716183*^9, 3.799335626092291*^9}, 
   3.799344116522127*^9, 3.800467905409665*^9, 3.800471568339971*^9, {
   3.801770869862853*^9, 3.801770898380573*^9}, 3.801771898474327*^9, {
   3.801783286578526*^9, 
   3.801783307130892*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"dafbaaef-4c65-45d3-8249-\
9f78c0efd46e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Arguments:\n\t",
 StyleBox["bb",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the 3D directrix, as a pure function. it should not be a cone \
point or the EOR of a tangent devleopable.\n\t",
 StyleBox["dd",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the 3D director, as a pure function.\n\t\[Sigma] \[LongDash] \
the orientation, which should be \[PlusMinus]1.\n\t",
 StyleBox["ui",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the initial value of the ",
 StyleBox["u",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "-parameter.\n\t",
 StyleBox["bi",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the initial position of the new directrix.\n\t",
 StyleBox["ti",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the initial tangent vector of the new directrix.\n\t{",
 StyleBox["u0",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["u1",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "} \[LongDash] the domain of interpolation."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.798572971597745*^9, 3.798573067343102*^9}, {
  3.799324637570926*^9, 3.799324655529855*^9}, {3.799332511270781*^9, 
  3.799332544247019*^9}, {3.7993355394999647`*^9, 3.7993355691326942`*^9}, {
  3.799398413591544*^9, 3.799398414782297*^9}, {3.801770901948718*^9, 
  3.801770945564329*^9}, {3.801783308931526*^9, 
  3.8017833171879478`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7387f243-d9e1-4028-842e-\
f54d0a6b0dcb"],

Cell["\<\
Options: 
\tResample, Options[FunctionInterpolation] are passed through.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.691235065551579*^9, 3.691235071734006*^9}, {
