   3.799332506695383*^9}, {3.799335590716183*^9, 3.799335626092291*^9}, {
   3.79940006479031*^9, 3.799400071345831*^9}, 3.800467905509326*^9, 
   3.800471568420375*^9},ExpressionUUID->"ae00311c-4c21-471d-80ef-\
d07392c9566a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Arguments:\n\t",
 StyleBox["b",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the 3D directrix, as a pure function. It should be \
well-behaved.\n\t",
 StyleBox["d",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the 3D director, as a pure function. It should be \
well-behaved.\n\t\[Sigma] \[LongDash] the orientation, which should be \
\[PlusMinus]1.\n\t",
 StyleBox["ui",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the initial value of the ",
 StyleBox["u",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "-parameter.\n\t",
 StyleBox["bbi",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the initial position of the new directrix.\n\t",
 StyleBox["ddi",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the initial director of the new surface.\n\t",
 StyleBox["tti",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the initial tangent vector of the new directrix.\n\t{",
 StyleBox["u0",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["u1",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "} \[LongDash] the interpolation domain."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.798572971597745*^9, 3.798573067343102*^9}, {
   3.799324637570926*^9, 3.799324655529855*^9}, {3.799332511270781*^9, 
   3.799332544247019*^9}, {3.7993355394999647`*^9, 3.7993355691326942`*^9}, 
   3.7993383148487873`*^9, {3.7993984604367857`*^9, 3.7993984619497843`*^9}, {
   3.7994001344108143`*^9, 
   3.799400136787469*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2bdc0552-4154-45d7-9c45-\
d38a726ae63a"],

