   3.801770638811822*^9},ExpressionUUID->"714431f5-eb26-47c9-a9c8-\
0d437907d4af"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Arguments:\n\t",
 StyleBox["ff",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the 3D space curve of the fold, as a vector-valued function.\n\
\t",
 StyleBox["\[Gamma]",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the fold angle.\n\t\[FinalSigma] \[LongDash] the fold \
orientation."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7994432330333567`*^9, 3.799443249729931*^9}, {
  3.799443348093048*^9, 3.799443354431157*^9}, {3.799938411803355*^9, 
