 ", ",
 StyleBox["rL",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["rR",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["\[Gamma]",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "} of the fold ruled neighborhood and its fold angle function in 2D."
}], "Text",
