  3.801648053640147*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"088bc316-9c41-43af-85d5-\
544fe0cc72c2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Options:\n\tSimplification \[Rule] None | Simplify | FullSimplify, \
specifies the level of simplification of intermediate results.\n\tAssumptions \
\[Rule] ",
 StyleBox["list",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", assumptions that should be passed to Simplify or FullSimplify.\n\t\
Options[DSolve] are passed through."
}], "Text",
