  3.801503016887034*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1ba34279-62fe-4fe0-868f-\
cb8ac46d67d4"],

Cell["\<\
These are the functions that find the fold that matches a specified surface \
to a partially specified surface in 2D and 3D.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8015030199710903`*^9, 
  3.801503049815153*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2eedf872-cd83-4a5a-b693-\
5958998c0dd0"],

Cell["\<\
Note that while some input variables are constant vectors (cone points, \
cylinder directrices), their corresponding outputs will always be functions.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.801908736057629*^9, 
  3.801908778802502*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"59be92d8-039e-41c1-b884-\
8bfa4e0b5189"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "FoldSurfaceToCone[",
 StyleBox["b1",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["d1",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["bb1",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["dd1",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", {",
 StyleBox["ui",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
