Cell["\<\
Example. Use the basic Graphics3D element but decorate it with the pivot \
plane and additional vectors.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.803579258158373*^9, 3.803579274254365*^9}, {
  3.803579675081974*^9, 3.803579681593576*^9}, {3.803587566476424*^9, 
