13b4206490a4"],

Cell["\<\
These are used to generate a labeled graphical representation of the first \
sector.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.71992048111835*^9, 3.719920493767061*^9}, 
   3.719925980306147*^9, {3.719944133878655*^9, 
