Cell["\<\
These are used to get the variables for the optimization. When it comes time \
to set constraints, we\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll want to consider only those \
vertices that are uniquely associated with the first sector.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7198538870855627`*^9, 3.719853907685924*^9}, {
  3.719920554215676*^9, 3.719920563398939*^9}, {3.911859354215522*^9, 
