Cell["\<\
Here\[CloseCurlyQuote]s a bit of analysis in which we explicitly enumerate \
the degrees of freedom in our variables and how they are absorbed by the \
constraint equations.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.719945549854871*^9, 
  3.7199455815432777`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"63358040-a36f-4570-b4f1-\
bd610ac29523"],

