   3.731190579511966*^9, {3.7311909712087393`*^9, 3.731190976510544*^9}, {
   3.731191140966232*^9, 3.731191164808674*^9}, 3.731191285801035*^9, 
   3.731191555354146*^9, 3.731191589937533*^9, 3.731191715243465*^9, 
   3.731192012426035*^9, 3.731192257555602*^9, 3.731194235494546*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "In[4196]:=",ExpressionUUID->"ae90953c-dc86-4a20-87ff-6f81f885d346"]
}, Closed]]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Paraboloidal flasher construction", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.825611385359231*^9, 3.825611390135093*^9}, {
  3.825679611672901*^9, 
  3.825679619808958*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6b229b84-792d-45dd-9a27-\
c8b4b312cec9"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Notes", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.719931102291793*^9, 
  3.719931102883951*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"12428040-89f2-4e1d-aec0-\
7d3141dc60af"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Here we set up a solution that solves all the relevant equations for a \
paraboloidal flasher. You can play with these values to change the design:\n\t\
",
 StyleBox["r",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the number of rings.\n\t",
 StyleBox["h",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the height order (how many turns a diagonal takes to get from \
the bottom to the top of a ring)\n\t",
 StyleBox["m",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the rotational symmetry\n\t",
 StyleBox["f",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the focal length of the paraboloid.\n\t",
 StyleBox["dr",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the radial spacing of successive vertices in the same plane.\n\
Note that the bottom is not necessarily perfectly flat in the folded form. \
Rather, the bottom of the outer ring and the central polygon are both forced \
to ",
 StyleBox["z",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "=0, but the other \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]down\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
vertices can (and typically do) take on slightly nonzero values."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.555839241395936*^9, 3.555839263945986*^9}, {
   3.5558406922764997`*^9, 3.555840696315197*^9}, {3.555850898870534*^9, 
   3.555850902915904*^9}, {3.555850936122521*^9, 3.555851037539441*^9}, {
   3.555853630666301*^9, 3.5558536429924*^9}, 3.55585432144669*^9, 
   3.555854357880516*^9, {3.555952632059319*^9, 3.55595263972264*^9}, {
   3.555953463903367*^9, 3.5559535181282387`*^9}, {3.71994562255157*^9, 
   3.719945639647678*^9}, {3.825607516811368*^9, 3.825607552924202*^9}, {
   3.825670377469508*^9, 
   3.825670381969665*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"42e8adaf-80ef-4542-bb5f-\
f8fae6f1566f"],

Cell["\<\
If the root-finder fails, the isometry values will be reported. Any values \
that are not zero (or nearly so) represent an isometry violation between the \
crease pattern and folded form.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.555851718871272*^9, 3.555851767067861*^9}, 
   3.719931106622401*^9},ExpressionUUID->"5371175e-a433-4a26-8cce-\
cdaa1a7dcc37"],

Cell["\<\
We introduce two new properties of the TGraph3DAssigned that we compute, to \
represent the 3-dimensional folded form and its Graph3D representation.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.913480660291991*^9, 
  3.913480697642445*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a68471cc-f1b2-46ba-8ebf-\
db68b5d16353"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
FlasherVerticesDP
FlasherDPGraph3D\
\>", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8256127620012083`*^9, 3.825612765769181*^9}, {
   3.82578410859354*^9, 3.825784111128182*^9}, 3.911829976335656*^9, {
   3.9132971771908007`*^9, 3.913297181508053*^9}, {3.9132972582067337`*^9, 
   3.9132972595719438`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"56f9ad0e-6ef8-4bbe-8889-\
93666ea268b8"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"FlasherVerticesDP", "::", "usage"}], 
   "=", "\"\<FlasherVerticesDP is a property of a 3D flasher TObj that gives \
the vertex coordinates of the deployed form.\>\""}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.913297186009398*^9, 3.913297219903*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[4197]:=",ExpressionUUID->"1c98fbd2-9000-41d9-b54e-2af2905a3383"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"FlasherDPGraph3D", "::", "usage"}], 
   "=", "\"\<FlasherDPGraph3D is a property of a 3D flasher TObj that gives a \
TGraph3DAssigned of the deployed form.\>\""}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.719936781358113*^9, 3.719936861796754*^9}, {
  3.825612748570276*^9, 3.825612789273394*^9}, {3.825679645827785*^9, 
  3.825679646675217*^9}, {3.825784145667516*^9, 3.82578414771333*^9}, {
  3.91182998637783*^9, 3.911829990847048*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[4198]:=",ExpressionUUID->"4b89af57-5d18-4b61-b231-2bb7ba9e6fc0"],

Cell["\<\
FlasherVerticesDP and FlasherDPGraph3D are used for paraboloidal flashers, \
but can also be used for more general 3D deployed forms.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.911829996116175*^9, 3.911830026947386*^9}, {
  3.913480711887584*^9, 
  3.913480719625524*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"687ae012-f929-4627-b29d-\
735eb26ad576"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["ParaboloidalFlasherFocalLength", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8256127620012083`*^9, 3.825612765769181*^9}, {
   3.82578410859354*^9, 3.825784111128182*^9}, 3.91183003039535*^9, 
   3.912574170566807*^9, 
   3.913480752082859*^9},ExpressionUUID->"9985dc07-f88d-4d72-91f5-\
c59952cdf686"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"ParaboloidalFlasherFocalLength", "::", "usage"}], 
   "=", "\"\<ParaboloidalFlasherFocalLength is a property of a paraboloidal \
flasher TObj that gives the focal length of the deployed paraboloid.\>\""}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.719936781358113*^9, 3.719936861796754*^9}, {
  3.825612748570276*^9, 3.825612789273394*^9}, {3.825679645827785*^9, 
  3.825679646675217*^9}, {3.8257841191871557`*^9, 3.825784141161351*^9}, {
  3.912574170585047*^9, 3.91257417058818*^9}, {3.913480752100735*^9, 
  3.913480752106574*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[4199]:=",ExpressionUUID->"42fe9dfa-9571-4d01-af21-6824643c4140"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "MakeParaboloidalFlasher[",
 StyleBox["r",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["h",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["m",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["f",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["dr",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "]\n\t(options) FlasherSectorDiagFoldLines"
}], "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.5558536563529053`*^9, 3.555853662782896*^9}, 
   3.555854321538135*^9, 3.5558543579886227`*^9, {3.555952668864356*^9, 
   3.55595266999219*^9}, {3.5559535297283783`*^9, 3.555953530327785*^9}, 
   3.719931029007852*^9, 3.719931391262084*^9, {3.825611156654202*^9, 
   3.825611160085581*^9}, 
   3.911830074930182*^9},ExpressionUUID->"d68846e9-4e33-4243-98c2-\
67a54f5ebd23"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "MakeParaboloidalFlasher[",
 StyleBox["r",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["h",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["m",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["f",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["dr",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] sets up and solves for the design of a paraboloidal flasher. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.555852179920305*^9, 3.555852292385377*^9}, {
   3.55585233169029*^9, 3.555852439928059*^9}, {3.5558534052815933`*^9, 
   3.555853419447778*^9}, {3.555853468093226*^9, 3.555853470086399*^9}, {
   3.555854321702399*^9, 3.55585432180553*^9}, {3.55585435811005*^9, 
   3.555854358243123*^9}, {3.555854490587639*^9, 3.555854512079216*^9}, {
   3.55587294036359*^9, 3.555872968375396*^9}, {3.555877743471888*^9, 
   3.555877759390441*^9}, {3.555953532176882*^9, 3.5559535350633707`*^9}, {
   3.555953668751749*^9, 3.555953717889508*^9}, {3.71993102902227*^9, 
   3.719931037998898*^9}, {3.825611166871396*^9, 3.82561117863798*^9}, 
   3.91183007496244*^9},ExpressionUUID->"50f0fadb-9d3a-4ef2-9ba1-\
d5be04d6169b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Arguments:\n\t",
 StyleBox["r",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " -- the number of rings.\n\t",
 StyleBox["h",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " -- the height order (how many turns a diagonal takes to get from the \
bottom to the top of a ring)\n\t",
 StyleBox["m",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " -- the rotational symmetry\n\t",
 StyleBox["f",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the focal length of the paraboloid\n\t",
 StyleBox["dr",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " -- the radial spacing of successive vertices in the same plane."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.719931396604858*^9, 3.71993146171073*^9}, {
  3.825611184189455*^9, 
  3.825611192245906*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"11015196-30ae-4871-9495-\
81090259b92f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Options:\n \tFlasherSectorDiagFoldLines \[Rule] ",
 StyleBox["fsdfl",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", specifies the orientation of the quad diagonal fold lines. Passed through \
to FlasherSectorFoldLines.\n \tTypeMinimumAngle is passed through to \
ReassignGraph3D."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.719931466591586*^9, 3.719931530773669*^9}, {
   3.7199413404217176`*^9, 3.719941380535017*^9}, 3.719945676239248*^9, {
   3.825679665889448*^9, 
   3.825679666673382*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a8f3208f-0cca-457c-81a2-\
c1d3ed376659"],

Cell["\<\
Returns: a TGraph3DAssigned, with a few additional properties:
\tFlasherDPGraph3D \[LongDash] a TGraph3DAssigned that characterizes the \
deployed state
\tFlasherLabeledCPSectorGraphics \[LongDash] a Graphics of the first sector \
of the CP with vertex labels
\tFlasherLabeledFFSectorGraphics3D \[LongDash] a Graphics3D of the first \
sector of the FF with vertex labels
\tFlasherCPGraphics \[LongDash] a Graphics of the CP with no polygons and \
color-coded fold lines
\tFlasherFFGraphics3D \[LongDash] a Graphics3D of the FF with no polygons and \
color-coded fold lines
\tFlasherDetails \[LongDash] a list of rules giving assorted numerical \
values.
\tFlasherIJKMap \[LongDash] a list that pairs {i,j,k} indices with their \
corresponding indices into the Vertices property of the TGraph.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.719936597709552*^9, 3.7199366164444847`*^9}, {
   3.7199369243486223`*^9, 3.719936925356485*^9}, {3.71994279501542*^9, 
   3.719942891998571*^9}, {3.825670439930659*^9, 3.8256704636906977`*^9}, 
   3.825778321737315*^9},ExpressionUUID->"3eadf2da-0073-4279-be01-\
b5a0df34d795"],

Cell["\<\
Note that the TGraph3DAssigneds that describe the stowed and deployed states \
each contain a TGraphAssigned that represents a crease pattern, but in this \
case, the crease pattern is the vertical projection of the deployed state, \
not a true crease pattern, i.e., not a development of the 3D form.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.825670467898032*^9, 3.825670552117023*^9}, {
  3.825679686737308*^9, 
  3.82567969269746*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7340f1a9-bd95-412a-b786-\
f9a61f8ec927"],

Cell["\<\
An interesting observation regarding the FlasherSectorDiagFoldLines option. \
With the default value of FlasherSectorDiagFoldLinesY, for r=3, h=3, the \
optimum solution can have two vertices coalesce, which causes all sorts of \
problems when it comes to planarization of the TPlaneGraph. However, using \
the option FlasherSectorDiagFoldLinesZ gives a good solution.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.825860598847724*^9, 
  3.825860693247171*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f9f449a5-e27e-43c5-a109-\
f3eb65fbf7f1"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"MakeParaboloidalFlasher", "::", "badiso"}], 
   "=", "\"\<Warning: isometry equations could not be satisfied. Residual \
error is `1.`\>\""}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7199425333213387`*^9, 3.719942597070138*^9}, {
   3.7199426442068787`*^9, 3.719942646486374*^9}, {3.825611208391045*^9, 
   3.825611208638151*^9}, 3.911830074975561*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "In[4200]:=",ExpressionUUID->"b6e4b732-36db-483c-9ae1-77570575ad51"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"MakeParaboloidalFlasher", "[", 
   RowBox[{
   "r_", ",", "h_", ",", "m_", ",", "f_", ",", "dr_", ",", "opts___"}], "]"}],
   ":=", 
  RowBox[{"Block", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
     "vars", ",", "p", ",", "px", ",", "py", ",", "pp", ",", "ppx", ",", 
      "ppy", ",", "ppz", ",", "dz", ",", "eqnfns", ",", "srules", ",", 
      "allvars", ",", "newvars", ",", "fwd", ",", "bkd", ",", "args", ",", 
      "soln", ",", "vertrules", ",", "isovals", ",", "cpsg", ",", "cplg", ",",
       "ffsg", ",", "fflg", ",", "picdia", ",", "pccdia", ",", "cpccdia", ",",
       "orverts", ",", "ffverts", ",", "oph", ",", "opw", ",", "cpicdia", ",",
       "ffdia", ",", "ffh", ",", "dpedges", ",", "ffedges", ",", "btverts", ",",
       "btedges", ",", "verts", ",", "edges", ",", "verts3d", ",", "tobj", ",",
       "vertsdp", ",", "tobjdp", ",", "allverts", ",", "allvinds", ",", 
      "ijkmap", ",", "msgs"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
     RowBox[{"PART", " ", 
      RowBox[{"I", ":", " ", 
       RowBox[{"solve", " ", "for", " ", "the", " ", "flasher"}]}]}], " ", 
     "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"vars", "=", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
       "p", ",", "px", ",", "py", ",", "pp", ",", "ppx", ",", "ppy", ",", 
        "ppz"}], "}"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"eqnfns", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Join", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"FlasherCPRotationFns", "[", 
         RowBox[{"vars", ",", "m"}], "]"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"ParaboloidalFlasherIsometryFns", "[", 
         RowBox[{
         "vars", ",", "r", ",", "h", ",", "m", ",", "f", ",", "opts"}], "]"}],
         ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"FlasherXYFns", "[", 
         RowBox[{"vars", ",", "r", ",", "h", ",", "m", ",", "dr"}], "]"}], ",",
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"FlasherOuterRingFns", "[", 
         RowBox[{"vars", ",", "r", ",", "h", ",", "m", ",", "dz"}], "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
         RowBox[{"dz", " ", "is", " ", "now", " ", "a", " ", "variable"}], 
         " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         SubscriptBox["ppz", 
          RowBox[{"0", ",", "0"}]], "}"}]}], 
       RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
         "forces", " ", "central", " ", "polygon", " ", "to", " ", "z"}], "=",
          "0"}], " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"srules", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Append", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"FlasherDefaultScalarRules", "[", 
         RowBox[{"vars", ",", "r", ",", "h", ",", "m", ",", "dr"}], "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"dz", "\[Rule]", "0"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     RowBox[{"allvars", "=", 
      RowBox[{"First", "/@", "srules"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"newvars", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Unique", "[", "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"Length", "[", "allvars", "]"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     RowBox[{"fwd", "=", 
      RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
       RowBox[{"Rule", ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"allvars", ",", "newvars"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     RowBox[{"bkd", "=", 
      RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"#2", "\[Rule]", "#1"}], "&"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"allvars", ",", "newvars"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     RowBox[{"args", "=", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"eqnfns", "/.", "fwd"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"newvars", ",", 
           RowBox[{"allvars", "/.", "srules"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ";",
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"soln", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Check", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"FindRoot", "@@", "args"}], ")"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"Abort", "[", "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"soln", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"soln", " ", "/.", " ", "bkd"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"vertrules", "=", 
      RowBox[{"ParaboloidalFlasherVertexRules", "[", 
       RowBox[{"vars", ",", "m", ",", "f", ",", "soln"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"isovals", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Abs", "/@", 
        RowBox[{"ParaboloidalFlasherIsometryFns", "[", 
         RowBox[{
         "vars", ",", "r", ",", "h", ",", "m", ",", "f", ",", "opts"}], 
         "]"}]}], "/.", "soln"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Plus", "@@", "isovals"}], ">", 
        SuperscriptBox["10", 
         RowBox[{"-", "6"}]]}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"Message", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"MakeParaboloidalFlasher", "::", "badiso"}], ",", 
         "isovals"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{"PART", " ", 
       RowBox[{"II", ":", " ", 
        RowBox[{
        "compute", " ", "graphical", " ", "bits", " ", "and", " ", 
         "diagnostic", " ", "info"}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"graphical", " ", "images"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"sector", " ", "&"}], " ", "pattern"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"dp", " ", "&"}], " ", "ff"}]}], " ", "*)"}], 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"cpsg", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Graphics3D", "[", 
        RowBox[{"FlasherLabeledSector", "[", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<p\>\"", ",", "p", ",", "r", ",", "h", ",", "m", ",", 
          "opts"}], "]"}], "]"}], "/.", "vertrules"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"cplg", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Graphics3D", "[", 
        RowBox[{"FlasherLines", "[", 
         RowBox[{"p", ",", "r", ",", "h", ",", "m", ",", "opts"}], "]"}], 
        "]"}], "/.", "vertrules"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"ffsg", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Graphics3D", "[", 
        RowBox[{"FlasherLabeledSector", "[", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<pp\>\"", ",", "pp", ",", "r", ",", "h", ",", "m", ",", 
          "opts"}], "]"}], "]"}], "/.", "vertrules"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"fflg", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Graphics3D", "[", 
        RowBox[{"FlasherLines", "[", 
         RowBox[{"pp", ",", "r", ",", "h", ",", "m", ",", "opts"}], "]"}], 
        "]"}], "/.", "vertrules"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{"central", " ", "polygon", " ", "incircle", " ", "diameter"}], 
      " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"picdia", "=", "1"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "central", " ", "polygon", " ", "circumcircle", " ", "diameter"}], " ", 
      "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"pccdia", "=", 
      RowBox[{"2", "*", 
       RowBox[{"Mag", "[", 
        RowBox[{"Take", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           SubscriptBox["p", 
            RowBox[{"0", ",", "0", ",", "0"}]], "/.", "vertrules"}], ",", 
