Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Veneer scoring", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.626480110048794*^9, 
  3.626480113538477*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"47b1066f-49fb-448b-bfec-\
6d95bc50e3fe"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Notes", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.624896623219928*^9, 
  3.624896623807993*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7e725f13-b4ce-4444-8648-\
fdb77cb52c75"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The functions in this section are used to create a laser scoring pattern \
for veneer+blocking layer laminate, e.g., wood veneer with a foil backing. \
For such a laminate, with a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["CO", "2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "60f487c8-e1cc-45d8-9df5-64228cdf8a04"],
 " laser, you can set the power to cut through the wood but not the foil or \
anything underneath it). We create hairline cut lines for border and mountain \
folds, but for valley folds, we need to leave a kerf, whose width is chosen \
based on the material thickness and the fold angle."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.624896625600288*^9, 3.6248967786861763`*^9}, {
  3.626368333522039*^9, 3.626368334447988*^9}, {3.626479674447003*^9, 
  3.626479677091934*^9}, {3.626535127622199*^9, 3.626535133544948*^9}, {
  3.62791377664596*^9, 
  3.627913797029608*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e94c88f0-1db4-4cb7-b638-\
f2587e9864bf"],

Cell["\<\
Kerfs can be created by setting the line width to something wider than a \
hairline, but if you do this with some (all?) laser cutters, they will render \
it using \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]carve\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] mode, which \
raster-scans the image as a bitmap. This is very inefficient since the fill \
factor is so low. So the functions VeneerMultiline and VeneerScoringGraphics \
render kerfed lines as a series of closely-spaced hairlines, with the number \
and position of the lines determined from the desired absolute line width and \
parameters that are characteristic of a given laser cutter. Default values \
match my own cutter, but you can override the defaults through options.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.6263683486791778`*^9, 3.626368499245738*^9}, {
  3.626479700811644*^9, 3.626479711442071*^9}, {3.626535151787546*^9, 
  3.626535155697552*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9eef1dde-b13d-493b-9aa5-\
e8f4eadc790c"],

Cell["\<\
There is an additional issue to contend with, which is how to treat the line \
ends. If we simply square off the ends, then when two multilines meet at a \
vertex, there is a small region of overlap, which can result in scorching or \
burn-through at the foil. To avoid this, we would like to bevel the ends of a \
multiline, so that when two multilines meet, there is no overlap between them.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.626479718905725*^9, 
  3.6264798816387997`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"cac27648-45e2-4a47-94dc-\
a7794a3fc28a"],

Cell["\<\
Similarly, when a regular cut line (mountain or border line) meets a (valley) \
multiline, we should pull back the regular line from the end, since the \
multiline will have already blown away the material where the endpoints of \
the multiline meet the cut line.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.626535182190424*^9, 
  3.62653526423971*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"cd81a6ca-77bc-4f4e-9869-\
2421e04e3d75"],

Cell["\<\
When it comes to scoring a full crease pattern into veneer, we would like to \
convert the valley folds to multilines based on their fold angle (larger fold \
angles need wider kerfs). In order to avoid burn-through, we bevel the ends \
of the valley fold multilines. The bevel angles depend on the desired \
thicknesses of the single or multilines of adjacent folds. All this gets \
sorted out in the function VeneerScoringGraphics.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.626479893314156*^9, 3.6264798942888103`*^9}, {
  3.626479962827533*^9, 
  3.626480089098501*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5f36c2c5-f907-4bfc-9975-\
525dfd7cd441"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "VeneerMultiline[{",
 StyleBox["va",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["vb",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "}, ",
 StyleBox["thickness",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["spacing",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "]\nVeneerMultiline[{",
 StyleBox["va",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["vb",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "}, ",
 StyleBox["thickness",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["spacing, ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
        RowBox[{"a", ",", "r"}]], ",", 
       SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
        RowBox[{"a", ",", "l"}]]}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
        RowBox[{"b", ",", "r"}]], ",", 
       SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
        RowBox[{"b", ",", "l"}]]}], "}"}]}], "}"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"d3aa6985-b88f-41bd-ab25-58053a69adec"],
 "]"
}], "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.624914034583505*^9, 3.6249140635484*^9}, {
  3.624914898178109*^9, 3.6249148999187813`*^9}, {3.626452070388404*^9, 
  3.626452159189064*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b4fe2ec2-799c-4eba-80cd-\
a3f158e79af7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "VeneerMultiline[{",
 StyleBox["va",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["vb",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "}, ",
 StyleBox["thickness",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["spacing",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] simulates a line segment of thickness ",
 StyleBox["thickness",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", running from ",
 StyleBox["va",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " to ",
 StyleBox["vb",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", by returning a list of line segments spaced spacing (or less) apart \
laterally. This is used to create kerfs using cut-lines (rather than \
raster-scanned carved patterns). Adjacent lines alternate in direction, so \
that vector-drawing will be done efficiently, going back and forth."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.624914093115496*^9, 3.624914236209228*^9}, {
   3.624914464707869*^9, 3.624914487464958*^9}, 3.6249149094089136`*^9, {
   3.626454610615247*^9, 3.62645461794764*^9}, {3.626479530311676*^9, 
   3.626479530693632*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"54605a3a-8e54-4e7e-abcf-\
417863569e4e"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"VeneerMultiline", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"va_", ",", "vb_"}], "}"}], ",", "thickness_", ",", "spacing_"}],
    "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"n", ",", "sp", ",", "xv"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"n", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Ceiling", "[", 
       RowBox[{"thickness", "/", "spacing"}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{"number", " ", "of", " ", "divisions"}], " ", "*)"}], 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"n", "\[Equal]", "0"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"Line", "[", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"va", ",", "vb"}], "}"}], "]"}], "}"}], ",", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"sp", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"thickness", "/", "n"}]}], ";", 
        RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
         RowBox[{"actual", " ", "spacing", " ", "to", " ", "use"}], " ", 
         "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"xv", "=", 
         RowBox[{"NormalizeReal", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"0", ",", 
               RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"1", ",", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ".", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"vb", "-", "va"}], ")"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
        RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
         RowBox[{"transverse", " ", "unit", " ", "vector"}], " ", "*)"}], 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Line", "[", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"If", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"EvenQ", "[", "i", "]"}], ",", "va", ",", "vb"}], 
               "]"}], "+", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"(", 
                RowBox[{"i", "-", 
                 RowBox[{"n", "/", "2"}]}], ")"}], "sp", " ", "xv"}]}], ",", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"If", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"EvenQ", "[", "i", "]"}], ",", "vb", ",", "va"}], 
               "]"}], "+", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"(", 
                RowBox[{"i", "-", 
                 RowBox[{"n", "/", "2"}]}], ")"}], "sp", " ", "xv"}]}]}], 
            "}"}], "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"i", ",", "0", ",", "n"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
   "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.624914243339609*^9, 3.624914450559286*^9}, {
   3.624914490540126*^9, 3.624914605700828*^9}, {3.624914689976576*^9, 
   3.624914711807117*^9}, 3.624914835953339*^9, 3.624914910832827*^9, {
   3.624991157519464*^9, 3.624991161243645*^9}, {3.624991241371951*^9, 
   3.62499124644433*^9}, 3.624991365724434*^9, {3.626479079183004*^9, 
   3.626479113733568*^9}, {3.626479533851488*^9, 3.626479535746792*^9}, 
   3.701092877095737*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "In[4214]:=",ExpressionUUID->"59493b29-48d9-4ac6-9506-4e091e62453c"],

Cell["Example", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.624914619770101*^9, 
  3.624914620560357*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"698a9c54-d08c-4e3e-b712-\
01b768e31e1a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"Graphics", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"VeneerMultiline", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"0", ",", "0"}], "}"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"1", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", "0.4", ",", "0.07"}],
        "]"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"Frame", "\[Rule]", "True"}]}], "]"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   "]"}], "//", "ShowExample"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.624914622483663*^9, 3.624914674542822*^9}, {
   3.624914745962447*^9, 3.624914812205872*^9}, {3.624914847412343*^9, 
   3.624914851481132*^9}, 3.624914911948113*^9, 3.626452054681889*^9, {
   3.626452225501812*^9, 3.626452232321463*^9}, {3.626479294887173*^9, 
   3.6264793027816687`*^9}, {3.626479584694063*^9, 3.626479589149816*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[4215]:=",ExpressionUUID->"e04457e6-30cd-4c96-9dc7-63be89bbca96"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "VeneerMultiline[{",
 StyleBox["va",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["vb",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "}, ",
 StyleBox["thickness",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["spacing, ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
        RowBox[{"a", ",", "r"}]], ",", 
       SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
        RowBox[{"a", ",", "l"}]]}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
        RowBox[{"b", ",", "r"}]], ",", 
       SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
        RowBox[{"b", ",", "l"}]]}], "}"}]}], "}"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"d86ac978-46ea-42dd-b3d5-aab6ee13d828"],
 "] does the same thing, but also angles the boundaries of the ends of the \
lines according to the angles ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
        RowBox[{"a", ",", "r"}]], ",", 
       SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
        RowBox[{"a", ",", "l"}]]}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
        RowBox[{"b", ",", "r"}]], ",", 
       SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
        RowBox[{"b", ",", "l"}]]}], "}"}]}], "}"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"5eedeff1-57ab-4137-b2b6-dd676b77aca1"],
 " at each end of the line. By suitably choosing the cut-back angle, one can \
avoid overlapping the multiple cut lines, which reduces burn-through at \
vertices where several multilines come together. The specified angles are the \
angles relative to the original line, right and left as one is looking from \
the line toward the vertex."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.626452175807632*^9, 3.626452207108288*^9}, {
  3.626452304266821*^9, 3.626452318645688*^9}, {3.626452724694355*^9, 
  3.626452744626068*^9}, {3.6264535833806973`*^9, 3.6264536063954372`*^9}, {
  3.626453670632476*^9, 3.6264536829982224`*^9}, {3.626455509434463*^9, 
  3.626455567230632*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"56888593-b90a-4cd5-996a-\
7d2884a84552"],

Cell["\<\
Note that the format of the four angles is the same as the elements of the \
list returned by function EdgeVertexAngles.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.626463613968143*^9, 
  3.626463644445602*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7e741957-116b-4b4a-90f3-\
b992398497f2"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"VeneerMultiline", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"va_", ",", "vb_"}], "}"}], ",", "thickness_", ",", "spacing_", ",", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"aar_", ",", "aal_"}], "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"abr_", ",", "abl_"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
     "n", ",", "sp", ",", "yv", ",", "xv", ",", "dx", ",", "pa", ",", "pb"}], 
     "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"n", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Ceiling", "[", 
       RowBox[{"thickness", "/", "spacing"}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "number", " ", "of", " ", "divisions", " ", "between", " ", "lines"}], 
      " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"n", "\[Equal]", "0"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"Line", "[", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"va", ",", "vb"}], "}"}], "]"}], "}"}], ",", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"sp", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"thickness", "/", "n"}]}], ";", 
        RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
         RowBox[{"actual", " ", "spacing", " ", "to", " ", "use"}], " ", 
         "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"yv", "=", 
         RowBox[{"NormalizeReal", "[", 
          RowBox[{"vb", "-", "va"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
        RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
         RowBox[{
         "unit", " ", "vector", " ", "along", " ", "the", " ", "line"}], " ", 
         "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"xv", "=", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"0", ",", 
              RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"1", ",", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ".", "yv"}]}], ";", 
        RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
         RowBox[{"transverse", " ", "unit", " ", "vector"}], " ", "*)"}], 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"Table", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"dx", "=", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{"i", "-", 
               RowBox[{"n", "/", "2"}]}], ")"}], "sp"}]}], ";", 
           "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
           RowBox[{"pa", "=", 
            RowBox[{"va", "+", 
             RowBox[{"dx", " ", "xv"}], "+", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"If", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"i", "<", 
                 RowBox[{"n", "/", "2"}]}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"-", 
                 RowBox[{"Cot", "[", "aal", "]"}]}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"Cot", "[", "aar", "]"}]}], "]"}], "dx", " ", 
              "yv"}]}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
           RowBox[{"pb", "=", 
            RowBox[{"vb", "+", 
             RowBox[{"dx", " ", "xv"}], "+", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"If", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"i", "<", 
                 RowBox[{"n", "/", "2"}]}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"Cot", "[", "abr", "]"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"-", 
                 RowBox[{"Cot", "[", "abl", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], "dx", " ", 
              "yv"}]}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
           RowBox[{"Line", "[", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"If", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"EvenQ", "[", "i", "]"}], ",", "pa", ",", "pb"}], 
               "]"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"If", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"EvenQ", "[", "i", "]"}], ",", "pb", ",", "pa"}], 
               "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"i", ",", "0", ",", "n"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
   "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.624914243339609*^9, 3.624914450559286*^9}, {
   3.624914490540126*^9, 3.624914605700828*^9}, {3.624914689976576*^9, 
   3.624914711807117*^9}, 3.624914835953339*^9, 3.624914910832827*^9, {
   3.624991157519464*^9, 3.624991161243645*^9}, {3.624991241371951*^9, 
   3.62499124644433*^9}, 3.624991365724434*^9, {3.626453625227742*^9, 
   3.6264536533904047`*^9}, {3.626454444356328*^9, 3.626454486575523*^9}, {
   3.626454555067942*^9, 3.626454565085102*^9}, {3.626454696812038*^9, 
   3.626454811751013*^9}, {3.6264549183155746`*^9, 3.626454938364893*^9}, {
   3.626454968606185*^9, 3.62645497107596*^9}, {3.626455003124722*^9, 
   3.626455009470815*^9}, {3.626455059720332*^9, 3.626455111315134*^9}, {
   3.626455142847862*^9, 3.626455256882806*^9}, {3.626455309175736*^9, 
   3.626455387755754*^9}, {3.626455431247838*^9, 3.626455433542891*^9}, {
   3.626478095131784*^9, 3.626478097905077*^9}, {3.626478936371724*^9, 
   3.626478949346506*^9}, {3.626479010640169*^9, 3.6264791014560623`*^9}, {
   3.626479538828494*^9, 3.626479540581801*^9}, 3.701092877805443*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "In[4216]:=",ExpressionUUID->"5c900275-d0ad-4b72-8360-7495cafb4d56"],

Cell["\<\
Example. A single multiline with distinct angles at each end. We\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll label the angles in this example, to make clear the \
orientation.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.624914619770101*^9, 3.624914620560357*^9}, {
