Cell["\<\
Example. A single 3D vertex with 3 valley folds and two different fold angles \
represented. This illustrates both beveled ends on multilines and cutbacks on \
Mountain and Border lines.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.626471005352613*^9, 3.626471010133881*^9}, {
  3.626471066435796*^9, 3.626471068922944*^9}, {3.626478167406793*^9, 
