  3.922205083020792*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"120559c9-1e9e-44d7-ab92-\
2e883490bb2e"],

Cell["\<\
We create functions returning sets of labels for vertices, edges, and faces \
of GraphicsComplex objects. These are mostly useful for illustration and \
debugging. We give them all distinct colors to easily tell them apart when \
all are present.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.922205085844698*^9, 3.922205120158208*^9}, {
  3.9222051773572817`*^9, 
  3.922205196493779*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"fa55df0f-d644-4700-bc7a-\
60a3a83fca74"]
}, Closed]],

