  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] a GraphicsComplex object.\n\t",
 StyleBox["fuzzrad",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the magnitude of the desired random perturbation vector."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.708344573320464*^9, 3.708344607630094*^9}, {
   3.708345245116144*^9, 3.708345245324918*^9}, {3.7083453404483213`*^9, 
   3.7083453413658752`*^9}, {3.708345420472466*^9, 3.708345443684782*^9}, {
   3.708413929199975*^9, 3.7084139428610916`*^9}, 3.7085915648513613`*^9, {
