 "Options:\n\tFuzzSeed \[Rule] ",
 StyleBox["seed",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " is passed through to FuzzPoints.\n\tFuzzMethod \[Rule] FuzzByVertex | \
FuzzByGroup, whether to perturb each vertex differently or all by the same "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.708591568529192*^9, 3.7085915851793556`*^9}, {
