Cell["\<\
Same thing, but set a maximum hinge length. This, combined with a minimum gap \
length, will force a single middle knuckle.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.935066804491929*^9, 3.935066812322877*^9}, {
  3.935067008482951*^9, 
  3.935067019850762*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b03448cb-cf64-43b1-b642-\
