Cell["\<\
In the course of this package, we\[CloseCurlyQuote]ve created a bunch of \
named examples whose names are in the global list $TGraphExamples. Here we \
construct a function that does a quick visualization of any of the named \
examples.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.719613806243847*^9, 
  3.719613862965153*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c993d0de-d1f5-437b-851e-\
