Cell["\<\
Messages used to appear in the Messages window, but with Mathematica 14, they \
appear in the notebook they were generated in. So we won\[CloseCurlyQuote]t \
report the loading time any more.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9334224430672092`*^9, 
