7e90bdb8d930"],

Cell["Changes for version 14.2", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.962634933323864*^9, 3.9626349376743393`*^9}, {
  3.96663001042161*^9, 
  3.966630010903675*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f9ae2c29-f7b5-4c9a-bdc3-\
7994a1898354"],

Cell["\<\
Added the PinHingeScaleKnuckles option for pin hinges to scale down knuckles \
for short edges only.
AddedBoxRatiosGC function to be a workaround for the Mathematica 14.3 bug in \
rendering improperly using BoxRatios\[Rule]Automatic option.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.962634941168928*^9, 3.962634962139894*^9}, {
  3.966630015480229*^9, 3.966630062941526*^9}, {3.967128069399685*^9, 
  3.96712812636854*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"99c8afae-1ba4-4bfe-bb89-\
a663fdc8ec9c"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Older version history", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.463666372736968*^9, 3.463666374256478*^9}, {
  3.617441115222986*^9, 3.6174411169755077`*^9}, {3.689266399241016*^9, 
  3.689266400540536*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f9d20700-8d74-4421-aae7-\
547c69b4dae6"],

Cell["Changes for version 14.1", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.962634933323864*^9, 
  3.9626349376743393`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"597a407c-39cb-45c7-8fed-\
96435048d017"],

Cell["Turned on several of the previous folded form examples.", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.962634941168928*^9, 
  3.962634962139894*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"45704c8e-2fa7-4796-af0f-\
680dc8bfab51"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 14.0
Recreated the JoinTo function, which used to be built-in but is no longer \
accessible.
Renamed some paraboloidal flasher functions to provide support for general \
(non-paraboloidal) sag functions for the deployed pattern.
Added more GC utilities to support creating 3D-printed models with compliant \
(flexible) hinges.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.911673660340651*^9, 3.911673688757218*^9}, {
  3.911827972529337*^9, 3.911828010425183*^9}, {3.911861581881441*^9, 
  3.911861590838825*^9}, {3.914839194809486*^9, 
  3.914839249030875*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0f76a15e-b43d-4589-8355-\
d1b8deaef566"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 13.0
Compatibility with Mathematica 13.0.
Fixed bug in Flasher functions to give all patterns an incircle diameter of \
1.
Move paraboloidal flasher functions into main Tessellatica.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.85491857134489*^9, 3.8549186017187753`*^9}, {
  3.855157297513191*^9, 
  3.855157316385264*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7c3561b1-bd07-417d-89f5-\
d8329add59d6"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 12.1d9
Replace ContainsQ with MemberQ due to namespace collision.
Replace IntersectsQ with IntersectingQ due to namespace collision.
Add support for parabolic flashers, e.g., MakeParaboloidalFlasher.
Remove NotchPlaneGraph.
Add SplitEdges, FaceShrink.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.825687030933462*^9, 3.825687103918152*^9}, {
   3.82568723654325*^9, 3.825687257150999*^9}, {3.825771312319482*^9, 
   3.825771327207808*^9}, {3.825866439928605*^9, 3.82586644731271*^9}, 
   3.825867432779309*^9, 
   3.911830075094749*^9},ExpressionUUID->"e144f616-173b-44d7-9987-\
cd847c21d9b0"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 12.1d8
Create VectorFunctionInterpolationAlt to use NDSolve trick to return a \
vector-valued interpolation function. 
Old-style still available as FunctionInterpolationAlt.
Update CurveInSurfaceSystem3D to reflect sign changes related to \
Frenet-Darboux angle.
Add option SurfaceOrientation in many surface-related functions.
Add function Degree4LastFoldDirection.
Add RodriguesMatrix.
Add options VectorLabelPosition and AxesLabelPosition for StyledVector, \
Styled2DAxes, and Styled3DAxes.
Swap the argument order in Functionize and replace current uses with \
FunctionizeOld to avoid breaking existing usage.
Change the argument form in RuledSurfaceNormal.
Deprecate CurveInSurfaceSystem3D and introduce DarbouxSystem3D instead.
Add StrictArguments and apply it to many of the curved folding functions.
Add InterpolationFunctionCount.
Extensive changes throughout the Curved Folding section. Many new functions, \
tweaking and/or deprecating old functions.
Replace VectorThickness with VectorThickness2D and VectorThickness3D so that \
default values for 2D and 3D StyledVector can be different.
Replace AxesThickness with AxesThickness2D and AxesThickness3D in \
Styled2DAxes and Styled3DAxes to mirror the changes in StyledVector.
Remove ScalarFunctionInterpolation, VectorFunctionInterpolation; replace with \
FunctionInterpolationAlt.
Add Resample option to FunctionInterpolationAlt.
Change the behavior of ShadowHeight within MakeShadow to always put the \
shadow relative to the lowest point of the elements.
Add UndefinedRulingLine style; redefined the standard MountainRulingLine and \
ValleyRulingLine for better readabiliity.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.797256142342958*^9, 3.797256193918239*^9}, {
   3.797263822250231*^9, 3.797263847984382*^9}, {3.7972655334393597`*^9, 
