UnfoldGraph2D, FoldGraph3D, and UnfoldGraph3D (and, incidentally, makes \
FoldGraph3D about 6\[Dash]7\[Times] faster).
Remove DartMatrix, DartMatrix2D, DartMatrix3D, and DartMatrixGraphics3D.\
\>", "Text",
