73771a022b50"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Changes for version 11.1d3\nIn tilings: rename decoration Vertices \[Rule] \
TileVertices, to avoid confusion with the Vertices of a TGraph.\nThe TGraph, \
TGraph2D, and TGraph3D decorations of tilings now have border edges (they \
didn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t used to), but we don\[CloseCurlyQuote]t render those \
edges when we\[CloseCurlyQuote]re rendering CP and FF decorations.\nRewrite \
MergeGraphs and JoinGraphs functions and their descendants to be more modular \
and extensible.\nAdd CollinearCleanup functions.\nDeprecate all \
BorderlessCreasePatternTo... conversion routines. Borderless TGraphs are, as \
a concept, deprecated because of all the complications they create (e.g., \
degree-1 vertices).\nAdd MonolithicEmbedTiling to replace EmbedTiling using \
Monolithic[*] decorations.\nAdd RotationMatrix3DTwixt.\nFix a regression bug \
in MakeFoldVectorsFromSectorsAndDihedrals.\nEliminate dependency on ",
 StyleBox["Combinatorica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " in favor of new built-in Graph functions. This affects FoldGraph2DAll, \
TwoColorGraph, EmbedGraph, FacesAboveOld, FacesAboveAutomatic.\nLighten the \
default rendering of hidden lines in symbolic origami styles.\nFix a \
longstanding bug in VertexEdgeAngles that didn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t properly \
handle (rare) reflex vertices, which then affected FoldGraph2D.\nAdd \
Ma11ImportRules (same as 10 and 9)."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7077531800599813`*^9, 3.707753181693239*^9}, {
   3.7077571028340282`*^9, 3.707757128297894*^9}, {3.70776236211184*^9, 
   3.707762386464588*^9}, {3.707773022567926*^9, 3.7077730784494276`*^9}, {
   3.707779130681692*^9, 3.707779146121725*^9}, {3.707821973715275*^9, 
   3.70782210426217*^9}, 3.7078238046074057`*^9, 3.707824770531624*^9, {
   3.707832570125495*^9, 3.707832580588008*^9}, {3.707861917227181*^9, 
