Cell["\<\
Changes for version 11.0d15
Change angle labels in CircularVertexLabels and SphericalAngleLabels to \
Symbol font.
Changed some usage of wording \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]dihedral angle\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] to \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]fold angle\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] for correctness.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.70448252289089*^9, 3.704482554403204*^9}, {
