Cell["\<\
Changes for version 11.0d14
Modified how PolygonalEllipseArc3D handles its RotationAxis option to support \
specification of direction.
Add InteriorEdgeMap.
Add GaussMapGraphics3D.
Add MakeWaterbombBase.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.703966552524909*^9, 3.703966568205022*^9}, {
  3.703966782743168*^9, 3.7039667854070396`*^9}, {3.703970031780848*^9, 
