  3.70138816687342*^9, 
  3.70138818547968*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5402f1e4-cde4-41e9-b2be-\
eb0c79b76f85"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 11.0d7
Add second version of RigidlyScaleFoldAngles to give scaling factor directly.
Fix a bug in DashedLine that occasionally produced spuriously long dashes.
Add an option to BackPlaneGraphics to specify vertices, rather than a facet, \
that define the backplane.
Add Rainbow.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.695237426775738*^9, 3.695237467744335*^9}, {
   3.695316579788797*^9, 3.6953166038772497`*^9}, {3.697674287002993*^9, 
   3.697674310673118*^9}, 
   3.700935449390054*^9},ExpressionUUID->"78146562-d3c3-4a2f-9f4a-\
fc118ca41d26"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 11.0d6
Add StyledRuledPatchSequence, which becomes the basis for StyledCurvedFold \
and related.
Replace FoldDivisions, RulingDivisions, RuledPatchDivisions, \
CrossPatchDivisions, with CurveDivisions.
Rename CrossCurveDivisions to CrossLineDivisions.
Add NUniformFold3DSystem.
Added new option DashCorners to DashedLine, to eliminate tiny fragments of \
dash that occasionally crashed TopWisdom printer driver (for laser scoring).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.694003240456243*^9, 3.694003308399675*^9}, {
   3.694007283779668*^9, 3.694007283806615*^9}, 3.694007490823187*^9, {
   3.69400768656995*^9, 3.694007739713328*^9}, {3.694009572407647*^9, 
   3.6940095743196077`*^9}, {3.6940118346508408`*^9, 3.694011845985887*^9}, {
