80926702abf7"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 11.0d4
Add PolygonSignedArea2D.
Add BackPlaneGraphics.
Add RigidlyScaleFoldAngles.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.693484722131357*^9, 3.693484735067171*^9}, 
   3.693484884327049*^9, {3.69349057880592*^9, 3.6934905836946*^9}, {
