   3.693513861309839*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"31ab62c0-49bf-4b37-a34e-\
4418c7270e6f"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 11.0d3
Modifications and additions to RigidlyFoldableQuadMesh.
Add MakeQuadMesh.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.693239669294663*^9, 3.693239672937634*^9}, {
  3.6934032592904177`*^9, 3.693403269927093*^9}, {3.693416439999142*^9, 
  3.693416443399103*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"002d2a0f-c3dc-43a6-921b-\
a64b9dc5e0e7"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 11.0d2
Add RigidlyFoldableQuadMesh.
Add NormalizeReal.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.693239652777821*^9, 
  3.693239662377282*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"efa11346-0c5a-49db-a31d-\
1c9af4d90730"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 11.0d1
Move to semantic versioning, to match Mathematica\[CloseCurlyQuote]s version \
numbers.
Remove options from FunctionizeOld.
Improve handling of Simplification option, add Assumptions.
Add FunctionInterpolationAlt.
Many, many changes and additions for curved folding.
Remove old conic section functions.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.69099906185026*^9, 3.690999082583339*^9}, {
   3.6912345907494802`*^9, 3.691234634285631*^9}, {3.692303762985476*^9, 
   3.692303806240989*^9}, {3.692555251932968*^9, 3.692555257294772*^9}, {
   3.6929881025800962`*^9, 3.69298810667413*^9}, 3.693239661514915*^9, 
   3.798622845702292*^9, 
   3.801733050859659*^9},ExpressionUUID->"465219c1-f11b-4383-8d85-\
9978a329526c"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 2.7d4
Remove StyledParameterizedPatchShadow.
Add StyledParameterizedRuledPatch.
Add more functions to Darboux3DSystemOld.
Add RotationMatrix3Du, for simpler algebraic expressions, and replaced \
RotationMatrix in in many functions where applicable.
Add PrettyParameters.
Fixed a bug in Styled3DAxes.
Add Styled2DAxes.
Add StyledVector and change axes and vector frame functions to use this \
function.
Add StyledFrenetTrihedron, StyledDarbouxTrihedron.
Add FunctionizeOld, SlotCount.
Add NeutralLighting.
Add symbolic styles for rulings, MountainRulingLine, ValleyRulingLine.
Tweak standard origami styles (thicken lines). 
Add more samples of symbolic styles.
Rewrite OrigamiStyle to allow overriding of styles by subsequent Style \
arguments.
Add InvisibleSphere, InvisibleCube.
Add Rotate3D, Rotate3Du.
Replace ConicSectionGraphics with StyledConicSection.
Add OrigamiSwatchGraphics, ReverseLineStyle, ReverseFillStyle.
Rename old Reflect[p,{q1,q2}] function to Reflect2D. Add N-dimensional \
Reflect and Reflectu functions.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.68808053809555*^9, 3.688080632112074*^9}, {
   3.688125248220742*^9, 3.688125263089419*^9}, {3.688134944788811*^9, 
   3.6881349538194537`*^9}, {3.688137501873036*^9, 3.688137510880512*^9}, {
   3.6881424545678043`*^9, 3.6881424604150877`*^9}, {3.6881658054967337`*^9, 
   3.688165828366077*^9}, {3.688988258605802*^9, 3.688988263099039*^9}, {
