   3.688080668334735*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a45929b0-7d27-46f8-b3cf-\
60526f012c8f"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 2.5d3 (ma10)
Add SemigeneralizedMiuraOri functions: MakeSemigeneralizedMiuraOriA, \
MakeSemigeneralizedMiuraOriB.
Add YoshimuraMiuraOri creation.
Extended TMiuraOri and renamed to TMiuraMarsOri (since it can create Barreto \
Mars patterns)
Add VertexRotateGraph3D function for rotating/translating TGraph3D objects.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.642361383260858*^9, 3.642361438176516*^9}, 
   3.642361530697719*^9, {3.642435532869281*^9, 3.642435555760382*^9}, {
