Cell[TextData[{
 "Changes for version 2.5d1 (ma10)\nUpdated for ",
 StyleBox["Mathematica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " 10 compatibility. Equivalent to 2.4d3 (ma9)."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.636743035603739*^9, 
  3.636743087704328*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3c2d12e4-347a-4b06-930f-\
69bbaa2fa4ab"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 2.4d3 (ma9)
Fixed a regression bug that lost TwoColorableArchimedeanPatchParity values.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.635167867669353*^9, 
  3.635167895700014*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"aaec4606-f9b2-4793-bd11-\
1bb3bc1f3fbb"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 2.4d2 (ma9)
Add JoinTilingPatches function, additional families of tilings.
Rewrote Periodic tilings section, eliminated concept of \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]patchspecs\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]; now tilings are \
defined directly from patches built using JoinTiling, and lattice vectors are \
extracted from the vertices of each patch.
Add support for Brocard polygons and their relationships to offset twist \
tiles.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.631032581410687*^9, 3.6310326114082947`*^9}, {
  3.631188477609489*^9, 3.631188532624649*^9}, {3.631470336609476*^9, 
  3.631470348659586*^9}, {3.688080673196052*^9, 
  3.688080674872015*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"42237623-49be-40ed-841f-\
1cdc3da52912"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 2.4d1 (ma9)
Add new form of SquareVertices.
Add RenderTileCache to speed up rendering of large tilings.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.6303241180867*^9, 3.630324131933169*^9}, {
  3.6303262346488047`*^9, 3.6303262466021347`*^9}, {3.688080675483107*^9, 
  3.688080676089374*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9aa48e83-0b2e-4ff9-9528-\
9365546216d5"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 2.4 (ma9)
Refactored the Tiling functions. Much rewriting, renaming, redefinitions. \
Tilings work differently now.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.629761335368471*^9, 
  3.629761374581352*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ada6f282-e206-47f6-967c-\
8292ef3e638d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Changes for version 2.3 (ma9)\nMajor rewriting of the symbolic styles. \
Renamed many symbolic styles; renamed HiddenLine to HiddenFoldedLine, added \
HiddenBorderLine, HiddenUnfoldedLine styles. Modified rendering functions to \
use the new styles.\n",
 "Add",
 " Trapezoid twist tile functions.\nRenamed *TwistFoldedGraph2D to \
*TwistGraph2D for consistency with other naming conventions.\nFixed a glitch \
in exporting of score patterns to remove ",
 StyleBox["Mathematica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "\[CloseCurlyQuote]s extra border from exported Graphics."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.628956212089889*^9, 3.628956254775199*^9}, {
   3.628956301915943*^9, 3.628956302091694*^9}, {3.6289737476313977`*^9, 
   3.628973748780969*^9}, {3.629458903468934*^9, 3.629458918265553*^9}, {
   3.629465486592585*^9, 3.629465511465433*^9}, {3.629504552423023*^9, 
   3.629504575403532*^9}, {3.629504625514576*^9, 3.629504637391639*^9}, 
   3.688080676735997*^9},ExpressionUUID->"3d6df88d-df50-4c04-b5dd-\
7e223a5570c7"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 2.2 (ma9)
Add modification to VisibleFoldedFormGraphics so that it can handle polygons \
with at most one reflex vertex, rather than only strictly convex polygons as \
before.
Fixed a lot of small bugs throughout that showed up generating figures for \
the twist-tiles chapter of TTT.
Rewrote CircularlyExtendEdges to better handle circular polygon pleats.
Renamed ordinary twist tiling functions to include CenteredTwist to \
distinguish from OffsetTwist functions.
Add CyclicPolygon twist tile functions.
Renamed most functions that began with \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Get\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] to eliminate the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Get\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] part (unnecessary).
Add support for offset triangle tiles, closed back polygon twists.
Redesigned the VisibleFoldedFormGraphics algorithm. It now seems to handle \
all twists, cyclic or not. Several new functions added in 2D inclusion, \
intersection, and clipping.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.628121173684861*^9, 3.628121216362335*^9}, {
   3.628521846163466*^9, 3.628521867682012*^9}, {3.628683529725091*^9, 
   3.628683623732097*^9}, {3.628787227913003*^9, 3.628787281961765*^9}, {
   3.628892365103437*^9, 3.628892456198869*^9}, 3.629458935832909*^9, {
   3.688080677370254*^9, 
   3.688080678776058*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"91f3a57f-e67f-4c15-b104-\
ea41250d929f"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 2.1 (ma9)
Major rewriting of the tiling-based tessellation functions and assorted \
related renaming. Full implementation of offset twist tiles, triangle tiles, \
and general polygon twist tiles. Note, in particular, that the function \
PlaceTiling was replaced by EmbedTiling. Add new function, JoinTiling, for \
building up tilings via relative placement.
Fixed a bug in BorderlessCreasePatternToPlaneGraphAssigned that was leaving \
orphan vertices when we merged crease pattern tiles.
Add FlopGraph2D, which makes it easy to \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]turn over\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] the folded form. See usage in woven tessellations.
Updated and renamed woven tessellation generation function to return a \
TGraph2D containing both CP and FF.
Add all-in-one function ExportPeforatedScoring for exporting perforated \
scoring files.
Add ExportVeneerScoring and cleaned up VeneerScoringGraphics.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.627406712220418*^9, 3.627406770894743*^9}, {
  3.627569039277384*^9, 3.627569079778407*^9}, {3.627652612502107*^9, 
  3.627652612650247*^9}, {3.627669014546612*^9, 3.627669040296281*^9}, {
  3.627767385432636*^9, 3.627767425220304*^9}, {3.627770103712779*^9, 
  3.627770124112377*^9}, {3.627839019463299*^9, 3.627839076911141*^9}, {
  3.6279345761888247`*^9, 3.627934604183536*^9}, {3.6880806808386717`*^9, 
  3.688080682813164*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"14aab231-ea02-4883-899e-\
9b09b0b236e6"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 2.0a3d3 (ma9)
Changes to TPlaneGraph interrogators:
\tRenamed EdgeAngles, EdgeAngles2D, EdgeAngles3D to EdgeFaceAngles, \
EdgeFaceAngles2D, EdgeFaceAngles3D 
\tRenamed VertexFaceAngles to VertexEdgeAngles for consistency in similarly \
named functions.
\tSplit VertexEdgeAngles into two functions, second function being \
SingleVertexEdgeAngles.
\tAdd EdgeVertexAngles function.
Add property EdgeEdgeAdjacency to TPlaneGraph.
Add support for beveled multilines in VeneerScoringGraphics.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.6264801929078507`*^9, 3.626480253791416*^9}, 
   3.626480322547277*^9, {3.627838958359935*^9, 3.627839017556403*^9}, {
   3.688080683646939*^9, 
   3.688080684972501*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8b789622-c593-4bbb-bc0a-\
b0b87489fe91"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 2.0a3d2 (ma9)
Add VeneerScoringGraphics to support veneer scoring with kerfs.
Add OrderMappingByVertices, used in going from a 3D model to a \
TGraph3DAssigned.
Add CreasePatternToGraph3DAssigned, used to go from angle-styled crease \
pattern to TGraph3DAssigned.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.624282300980389*^9, 3.624282382915517*^9}, {
   3.625164116301709*^9, 3.625164141609503*^9}, {3.626360741316718*^9, 
   3.626360789796381*^9}, {3.626360870372284*^9, 3.6263609022210693`*^9}, {
   3.626367180708127*^9, 3.626367183713477*^9}, {3.62636816452453*^9, 
   3.626368229815153*^9}, {3.626459175598835*^9, 3.626459204058214*^9}, {
   3.626459569188621*^9, 3.626459592808419*^9}, {3.626460378537859*^9, 
   3.626460405973003*^9}, {3.6264604432237177`*^9, 3.62646050663405*^9}, {
   3.626465661420742*^9, 3.626465673555595*^9}, {3.626480208803035*^9, 
   3.6264802099229198`*^9}, 3.649881943769347*^9, 3.649882096174056*^9, {
   3.688080685596818*^9, 
   3.688080686548477*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ecaca79c-3091-4f0c-bfa5-\
f95c56921adc"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 2.0a3d1 (ma9)
Add UnitRegularPolygonLinesLabeledTile, MakeUnitRegularPolygonPatchLabeled
Renamed 2-argument version of MakeUnitRegularPolygonPatch to \
MakeUnitRegularPolygonPatchColored
Add ScoreLineThickness option to ScoringStyle to support output of fully \
scaled score patterns.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.624282300980389*^9, 3.624282382915517*^9}, {
   3.625164116301709*^9, 3.625164141609503*^9}, {3.626360741316718*^9, 
   3.626360789796381*^9}, {3.626360870372284*^9, 3.626360898885044*^9}, {
   3.6273396990347443`*^9, 3.627339699432205*^9}, 3.627524113236156*^9, {
   3.688080687176871*^9, 3.6880806877137427`*^9}, 
   3.693872237476164*^9},ExpressionUUID->"9e442f6f-bfbc-479f-9d17-\
11a0fa2c2e77"],

Cell["\<\
Changes for version 2.0a2 (ma9):
Add Import/Export functions for compatibility with Tachi\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
FreeForm
Improved pruning for tiling-based tessellations, adding \
MakePrunedLatticeTiling.
Add more examples to tiling-based tessellations.
Renamed \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]GridGraph\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] functions to \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]QuadMesh\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] for consistency with \
existing terminology
Add functions for handling major-first and minor-first sector angle lists for \
TDegree4Vertex3D
Add maximum and binding angles for TDegree4Vertex3D
Add class TLinearChain and associated constructors.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.617441024275882*^9, 3.617441106771418*^9}, {
  3.617443986867074*^9, 3.6174440196467247`*^9}, {3.617463156242606*^9, 
