Add Ma8ImportRules for importing drawings and crease patterns.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.534429215736463*^9, 3.5344292351266747`*^9}, {
   3.5920407098059683`*^9, 3.592040725867827*^9}, 
   3.688080691905472*^9},ExpressionUUID->"77911243-3379-4ba1-ac24-\
83a5d1ad7afc"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Changes for ",
 StyleBox["Mathematica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " 8 compatibility 1.0d7 (ma8):\n\tDirectedEdge \[Rule] DirectedEdgeArrow \
(because ",
 StyleBox["Mathematica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " now claims DirectedEdge for its own nefarious purposes\n\tCrossedEdge \
\[Rule] CrossedEdgeArrow (to keep naming similar)\n\tVertexLabels \[Rule] \
StdVertexLabels (again, ",
 StyleBox["Mathematica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " now uses that symbol for built-in graphs)\n\tEdgeLabels \[Rule] \
StdEdgeLabels (ditto)\n\tPolyLabels \[Rule] StdPolyLabels (to keep naming \
similar)\nAlso fixes a bug in primal-dual tessellation construction.\n\
Improved version of CircumCircleInfo for 3 points (exact algebraic \
construction)\nChanged MakePrimalDualTwistTessellationEdges to \
MakePrimalDualTwistTessellation"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.533504501423571*^9, 3.533504568089201*^9}, {
   3.53350495862564*^9, 3.533505074609795*^9}, {3.534429260141302*^9, 
   3.534429263156915*^9}, {3.5920408061772547`*^9, 3.592040844350789*^9}, 
   3.592040883202317*^9, 3.5922577004705153`*^9, 3.5928287097595987`*^9, {
   3.59420889081738*^9, 3.59420889835896*^9}, 3.6152889521123857`*^9, 
   3.615294795946905*^9},ExpressionUUID->"f9ae006f-334f-463a-8ce5-\
11e9798d3048"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Final ",
 StyleBox["Mathematica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " 7 version: 1.0d4 (ma7)"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.5920407681237693`*^9, 3.592040781993292*^9}, {
  3.59204082105604*^9, 
  3.592040822453693*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7e51d37e-5015-4cc8-8b8a-\
79e4b7df86da"],

Cell["\<\
Contains contributions from:
\tOld Randlett Bird (ca. 1991)
\tTessellation Tools.m (ca. 1999)
\tTessellation Circle Packing xx.nb
\tFoldedForm2D & Tilings xx.nb
\tGeneralized Vertices (Ma7).nb
\tFlangedPot notebooks (going back to Ma5)
\tPenroseTiles3D.nb
\tPleated Cone (Ma8).nb\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.45752817600804*^9, 3.457528207205949*^9}, {
   3.457792397095303*^9, 3.457792448406523*^9}, {3.533658142736409*^9, 
