Cell["\<\
And if we make the thickness microscopic, then using the default rules, we \
should end up with the planar values (and we do).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8256072986576447`*^9, 3.825607329346389*^9}, {
  3.911839382867838*^9, 3.911839386932963*^9}, {3.9134767447401257`*^9, 
