 ", ",
 StyleBox["t",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] sets up and solves for the design of the embedded zero-thickness (EZT) \
surface for a thick flasher with a non-developable deployed form that can be \
used to create a thick planar deployed form."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.555852179920305*^9, 3.555852292385377*^9}, {
   3.55585233169029*^9, 3.555852439928059*^9}, {3.5558534052815933`*^9, 
   3.555853419447778*^9}, {3.555853468093226*^9, 3.555853470086399*^9}, {
   3.555854321702399*^9, 3.55585432180553*^9}, {3.55585435811005*^9, 
   3.555854358243123*^9}, {3.555854490587639*^9, 3.555854512079216*^9}, {
   3.55587294036359*^9, 3.555872968375396*^9}, {3.555877743471888*^9, 
   3.555877759390441*^9}, {3.555953532176882*^9, 3.5559535350633707`*^9}, {
   3.555953668751749*^9, 3.555953717889508*^9}, {3.71993102902227*^9, 
   3.719931037998898*^9}, {3.825611166871396*^9, 3.82561117863798*^9}, 
   3.91183007496244*^9, {3.911834179717301*^9, 3.911834224410527*^9}, {
   3.913479657740476*^9, 
   3.9134796673689003`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7cb9cba9-b937-4eac-9fb4-\
e09d2f23a28d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Arguments:\n\t",
 StyleBox["r",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " -- the number of rings.\n\t",
 StyleBox["h",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " -- the height order (how many turns a diagonal takes to get from the \
bottom to the top of a ring).\n\t",
 StyleBox["m",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " -- the rotational symmetry.\n\t",
 StyleBox["t",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] the desired thickness of the thick panels of the stowed or \
deployed form."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.719931396604858*^9, 3.71993146171073*^9}, {
  3.825611184189455*^9, 3.825611192245906*^9}, {3.9118342573067417`*^9, 
  3.91183427491676*^9}, {3.913545225008062*^9, 3.913545226379066*^9}, {
  3.9341296593622828`*^9, 
  3.9341296650252113`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"093da10c-650e-4f46-82ae-\
4846a940e18f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Options:\n \tFlasherSectorDiagFoldLines \[Rule] ",
 StyleBox["fsdfl",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", specifies the orientation of the quad diagonal fold lines. Passed through \
to FlasherSectorFoldLines.\n \tTypeMinimumAngle is passed through to \
ReassignGraph3D."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.719931466591586*^9, 3.719931530773669*^9}, {
   3.7199413404217176`*^9, 3.719941380535017*^9}, 3.719945676239248*^9, {
   3.825679665889448*^9, 
   3.825679666673382*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5f8576e2-16d6-4ee1-a6fa-\
2fa3ddb60ba4"],

Cell["\<\
Returns: a TGraph3DAssigned, with a few additional properties:
\tThickFlasherThickness \[LongDash] the desired thickness of the flasher.
\tThickFlasherMajorEdges \[LongDash] the indices of the major edges of the \
flasher.
\tThickFlasherMinorEdges \[LongDash] the indices of the minor edges of the \
flasher.
\tThickFlasherDiagonalEdges \[LongDash] the indices of the diagonal edges of \
the flasher.
\tThickFlasherCrossQuadEdges \[LongDash] the indices of the cross-quad edges \
of the flasher.
\tThickFlasherCentralPolygonEdges \[LongDash] the indices of the central \
polygon edges of the flasher.
\tFlasherVerticesDP \[LongDash] the 3D vertices of the deployed form of the \
flasher.
\tFlasherDPGraph3D \[LongDash] a TGraph3DAssigned that characterizes the \
deployed state.
\tFlasherLabeledCPSectorGraphics \[LongDash] a Graphics of the first sector \
of the CP with vertex labels.
\tFlasherLabeledFFSectorGraphics3D \[LongDash] a Graphics3D of the first \
sector of the FF with vertex labels.
\tFlasherCPGraphics \[LongDash] a Graphics of the CP with no polygons and \
color-coded fold lines.
\tFlasherFFGraphics3D \[LongDash] a Graphics3D of the FF with no polygons and \
color-coded fold lines.
\tFlasherDetails \[LongDash] a list of rules giving assorted numerical \
measures of the pattern.
\tFlasherIJKMap \[LongDash] a list that pairs {i,j,k} indices with their \
corresponding indices into the Vertices property of the TGraph.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.719936597709552*^9, 3.7199366164444847`*^9}, {
   3.7199369243486223`*^9, 3.719936925356485*^9}, {3.71994279501542*^9, 
   3.719942891998571*^9}, {3.825670439930659*^9, 3.8256704636906977`*^9}, 
   3.825778321737315*^9, {3.911899324455746*^9, 3.911899330624224*^9}, {
   3.913297065329698*^9, 3.9132970847800817`*^9}, {3.913545250792201*^9, 
   3.913545277387798*^9}, {3.9369761328608828`*^9, 
   3.936976196218824*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f8cb5283-315d-4e83-9274-\
b0a31790e30c"],

Cell["\<\
For compatibility with other Flasher functions, we assume that the central \
polygon has a unit incircle, so the specified thickness should be relative to \
that. See MakeThickFlasherScaled to compute the scaling factor and \
dimensionless thickness that gives a desired panel thickness and stowed or  \
deployed circumcircle.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9341296733431*^9, 3.934129714953693*^9}, {
  3.934129751865621*^9, 
  3.93412979504867*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2a4a0d85-7c4b-43b8-9268-\
0083d596e7c7"],

Cell["\<\
Note that the TGraph3DAssigneds that describe the stowed and deployed states \
each contain a TGraphAssigned that represents a crease pattern, but in this \
case, the crease pattern is the vertical projection of the deployed state, \
not a true crease pattern, i.e., not a development of the 3D form.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.825670467898032*^9, 3.825670552117023*^9}, {
  3.825679686737308*^9, 
  3.82567969269746*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"efcf1a73-a480-4dae-8573-\
e8f28c722462"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"MakeThickFlasher", "::", "badiso"}], 
   "=", "\"\<Warning: isometry equations could not be satisfied. Residual \
error is `1.`\>\""}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7199425333213387`*^9, 3.719942597070138*^9}, {
   3.7199426442068787`*^9, 3.719942646486374*^9}, {3.825611208391045*^9, 
   3.825611208638151*^9}, 3.911830074975561*^9, {3.911834288021735*^9, 
   3.91183428854167*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[4493]:=",ExpressionUUID->"703f3867-7165-4c06-ae5d-90a1d93e59e8"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"MakeThickFlasher", "[", 
   RowBox[{"r_", ",", "h_", ",", "m_", ",", "t_", ",", "opts___"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
     "vars", ",", "p", ",", "px", ",", "py", ",", "pp", ",", "ppx", ",", 
      "ppy", ",", "ppz", ",", "dz", ",", "eqnfns", ",", "srules", ",", 
      "allvars", ",", "newvars", ",", "fwd", ",", "bkd", ",", "args", ",", 
      "soln", ",", "vertrules", ",", "isovals", ",", "cpsg", ",", "cplg", ",",
       "ffsg", ",", "fflg", ",", "picdia", ",", "pccdia", ",", "cpccdia", ",",
       "orverts", ",", "ffverts", ",", "oph", ",", "opw", ",", "cpicdia", ",",
       "ffdia", ",", "ffh", ",", "dpedges", ",", "ffedges", ",", "btverts", ",",
       "btedges", ",", "verts", ",", "edges", ",", "verts3d", ",", "tobj", ",",
       "vertsdp", ",", "tobjdp", ",", "allverts", ",", "allvinds", ",", 
      "ijkmap", ",", "vmap", ",", "ne", ",", "emap", ",", "cpedges", ",", 
      "sfedges", ",", "mjedges", ",", "mnedges", ",", "dgedges", ",", 
      "cqedges", ",", "msgs"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
     RowBox[{"PART", " ", 
      RowBox[{"I", ":", " ", 
       RowBox[{"solve", " ", "for", " ", "the", " ", "flasher"}]}]}], " ", 
     "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"vars", "=", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
       "p", ",", "px", ",", "py", ",", "pp", ",", "ppx", ",", "ppy", ",", 
        "ppz"}], "}"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"eqnfns", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Join", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
        RowBox[{
        "Pin", " ", "rotation", " ", "to", " ", "that", " ", "of", " ", "the",
          " ", "default", " ", "pattern"}], " ", "*)"}], 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"FlasherCPRotationFns", "[", 
         RowBox[{"vars", ",", "m"}], "]"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
         RowBox[{
         "Enforce", " ", "isometry", " ", "between", " ", "the", " ", 
          "deployed", " ", "pattern", " ", 
          RowBox[{"(", "DP", ")"}], " ", "and", " ", "stowed", " ", "pattern",
           " ", 
          RowBox[{"(", "FF", ")"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"ThickFlasherIsometryFns", "[", 
         RowBox[{
         "vars", ",", "r", ",", "h", ",", "m", ",", "t", ",", "opts"}], "]"}],
         ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Pin", " ", "the", " ", "x"}], "-", 
          RowBox[{
          "y", " ", "coordinates", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "FF", " ", 
           "to", " ", "match", " ", "those", " ", "that", " ", "come", " ", 
           "from", " ", "solving", " ", "for", " ", "the", " ", 
           "projection"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"ThickFlasherXYFns", "[", 
         RowBox[{"vars", ",", "r", ",", "h", ",", "m", ",", "t"}], "]"}], ",",
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Pin", " ", "the", " ", "z"}], "-", 
           RowBox[{
           "values", " ", "of", " ", "the", " ", "outer", " ", "ring", " ", 
            "to", " ", "the", " ", "same", " ", "value"}]}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{
          "which", " ", "is", " ", "a", " ", "slack", " ", "variable", " ", 
           "dz"}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"FlasherOuterRingFns", "[", 
         RowBox[{"vars", ",", "r", ",", "h", ",", "m", ",", "dz"}], "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
         RowBox[{"dz", " ", "is", " ", "now", " ", "a", " ", "variable"}], 
         " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Force", " ", "the", " ", "z"}], "-", 
           RowBox[{
           "height", " ", "of", " ", "central", " ", "polygon", " ", "to", " ",
             "z"}]}], "=", "0"}], " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         SubscriptBox["ppz", 
          RowBox[{"0", ",", "0"}]], "}"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}], ";",
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"srules", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Append", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"FlasherDefaultScalarRules", "[", 
         RowBox[{"vars", ",", "r", ",", "h", ",", "m", ",", "0"}], "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"dz", "\[Rule]", "0"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"allvars", "=", 
      RowBox[{"First", "/@", "srules"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"newvars", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Unique", "[", "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"Length", "[", "allvars", "]"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     RowBox[{"fwd", "=", 
      RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
       RowBox[{"Rule", ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"allvars", ",", "newvars"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     RowBox[{"bkd", "=", 
      RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"#2", "\[Rule]", "#1"}], "&"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"allvars", ",", "newvars"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     RowBox[{"args", "=", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"eqnfns", "/.", "fwd"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"newvars", ",", 
           RowBox[{"allvars", "/.", "srules"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ";",
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"soln", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Check", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"FindRoot", "@@", "args"}], ")"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"Abort", "[", "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"soln", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"soln", " ", "/.", " ", "bkd"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"vertrules", "=", 
      RowBox[{"ThickFlasherVertexRules", "[", 
       RowBox[{"vars", ",", "r", ",", "h", ",", "m", ",", "t", ",", "soln"}], 
       "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Verify", " ", "isometry"}], " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"isovals", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Abs", "/@", 
        RowBox[{"ThickFlasherIsometryFns", "[", 
         RowBox[{
         "vars", ",", "r", ",", "h", ",", "m", ",", "t", ",", "opts"}], 
         "]"}]}], "/.", "soln"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Plus", "@@", "isovals"}], ">", 
        SuperscriptBox["10", 
         RowBox[{"-", "6"}]]}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"Message", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"MakeThickFlasher", "::", "badiso"}], ",", "isovals"}], 
        "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{"PART", " ", 
       RowBox[{"II", ":", " ", 
        RowBox[{
        "compute", " ", "graphical", " ", "bits", " ", "and", " ", 
         "diagnostic", " ", "info"}]}]}], " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"graphical", " ", "images"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"sector", " ", "&"}], " ", "pattern"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"dp", " ", "&"}], " ", "ff"}]}], " ", "*)"}], 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"cpsg", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Graphics3D", "[", 
         RowBox[{"FlasherLabeledSector", "[", 
          
          RowBox[{"\"\<p\>\"", ",", "p", ",", "r", ",", "h", ",", "m", ",", 
           "opts"}], "]"}], "]"}], "/.", 
        RowBox[{"FlasherWrapRules", "[", 
         RowBox[{"p", ",", "m"}], "]"}]}], "/.", "vertrules"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"cplg", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Graphics3D", "[", 
         RowBox[{"FlasherLines", "[", 
          RowBox[{"p", ",", "r", ",", "h", ",", "m", ",", "opts"}], "]"}], 
         "]"}], "/.", 
        RowBox[{"FlasherWrapRules", "[", 
         RowBox[{"p", ",", "m"}], "]"}]}], "/.", "vertrules"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"ffsg", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Graphics3D", "[", 
         RowBox[{"FlasherLabeledSector", "[", 
          
          RowBox[{"\"\<pp\>\"", ",", "pp", ",", "r", ",", "h", ",", "m", ",", 
           "opts"}], "]"}], "]"}], "/.", 
        RowBox[{"FlasherWrapRules", "[", 
         RowBox[{"pp", ",", "m"}], "]"}]}], "/.", "vertrules"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"fflg", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Graphics3D", "[", 
         RowBox[{"FlasherLines", "[", 
          RowBox[{"pp", ",", "r", ",", "h", ",", "m", ",", "opts"}], "]"}], 
         "]"}], "/.", 
        RowBox[{"FlasherWrapRules", "[", 
         RowBox[{"pp", ",", "m"}], "]"}]}], "/.", "vertrules"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{"central", " ", "polygon", " ", "incircle", " ", "diameter"}], 
      " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"picdia", "=", "1"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "central", " ", "polygon", " ", "circumcircle", " ", "diameter"}], " ", 
      "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"pccdia", "=", 
      RowBox[{"2", "*", 
       RowBox[{"Mag", "[", 
        RowBox[{"Take", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           SubscriptBox["p", 
            RowBox[{"0", ",", "0", ",", "0"}]], "/.", "vertrules"}], ",", 
          "2"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{"deployed", " ", "pattern", " ", "outermost", " ", "vertices"}],
       " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"orverts", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"FlasherOuterRingSectorVertices", "[", 
        RowBox[{"p", ",", "r", ",", "h", ",", "m", ",", "0"}], "]"}], "/.", 
       "vertrules"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{"deployed", " ", "pattern", " ", "incircle", " ", "diameter"}], 
      " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"cpicdia", "=", 
      RowBox[{"2", "*", 
       RowBox[{"Min", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Mag", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Take", "[", 
            RowBox[{"#", ",", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", "orverts"}], 
        "]"}]}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "deployed", " ", "pattern", " ", "circumcircle", " ", "diameter"}], " ",
       "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"cpccdia", "=", 
      RowBox[{"2", "*", 
       RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Mag", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Take", "[", 
            RowBox[{"#", ",", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", "orverts"}], 
        "]"}]}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{"outermost", " ", "panel", " ", "vertical", 
       RowBox[{"(", "ish", ")"}], " ", "edge", " ", "length", " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"approximately", ",", " ", "height"}], ")"}]}], " ", "*)"}], 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"oph", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Mag", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          SubscriptBox["p", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"r", "*", "h"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"r", "*", "h"}], ",", "0"}]], "-", 
          SubscriptBox["p", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"r", "*", "h"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{"r", "-", "1"}], ")"}], "*", "h"}], ",", "0"}]]}], 
         ")"}], "/.", "vertrules"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{"outermost", " ", "panel", " ", "horizontal", 
       RowBox[{"(", "ish", ")"}], " ", "edge", " ", "length", " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"approximately", " ", "width"}], ")"}]}], " ", "*)"}], 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"opw", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Mag", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          SubscriptBox["p", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"r", "*", "h"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"r", "*", "h"}], ",", "0"}]], "-", 
          SubscriptBox["p", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"r", "*", "h"}], "-", "1"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"r", "*", "h"}], ",", "0"}]]}], ")"}], "/.", 
        "vertrules"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{"outermost", " ", "vertices", " ", "in", " ", "ff"}], " ", 
      "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"ffverts", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"FlasherFirstSectorVertices", "[", 
        RowBox[{"pp", ",", "r", ",", "h"}], "]"}], "/.", "vertrules"}]}], ";",
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{"folded", " ", "form", " ", "circumcircle", " ", "diameter"}], 
      " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"ffdia", "=", 
      RowBox[{"2", "*", 
       RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Mag", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Take", "[", 
            RowBox[{"#", ",", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", "ffverts"}], 
        "]"}]}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{"folded", " ", "form", " ", "height"}], " ", "*)"}], 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"ffh", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
        RowBox[{"Last", "/@", "ffverts"}], "]"}], "-", 
       RowBox[{"Min", "[", 
        RowBox[{"Last", "/@", "ffverts"}], "]"}]}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{"PART", " ", 
       RowBox[{"III", ":", " ", 
        RowBox[{"construct", " ", "a", " ", "TGraph3DAssigned"}]}]}], " ", 
      "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
      RowBox[{
      "lists", " ", "of", " ", "point", " ", "pairs", " ", "for", " ", "both",
        " ", "cp", " ", "and", " ", "ff"}], " ", "*)"}], 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"dpedges", "=", 
