Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Thick flasher analytics", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.91242749967798*^9, 
  3.912427510852927*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d6089625-3fd8-4740-ab8c-\
c44dc5142cfc"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Notes", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.913552353391319*^9, 
  3.913552353806963*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ca75db96-20a3-4a2c-946a-\
91bf39e3461f"],

Cell["\<\
Because the deployed form is non-planar (with non-zero sag that varies from \
vertex to vertex), the EZT surface is likely to be non-developable, i.e., \
with angle sums around vertices that are greater than or less than 360\
\[Degree]. Here we construct some analytic functions that let us characterize \
the non-developability.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.913552365278744*^9, 
  3.913552441633662*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"edc01e6a-e7bd-45a7-a632-\
fd7ab830003b"],

Cell["\<\
Note that any vertex with a negative developability excess (i.e., a \
developability deficit) is inherently \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]conical\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], and thus is inherently bistable. It could be \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]popped\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] from convex to concave. \
This is a different kind of bistability from the already well-known \
non-rigid-foldability of (non-cut) flashers. Hopefully, any deficits will be \
small, making them easy to pop from one direction to the other.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.913552450543825*^9, 
  3.913552547210336*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"fe4b5307-52f3-43af-86dc-\
32bcc08ffe42"],

Cell["\<\
We also provide named functions for constructing the fold angles of the EZT \
surface in the folded form and deployed pattern.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9172806756179657`*^9, 3.917280730387352*^9}, {
  3.91728666035441*^9, 
  3.917286660777934*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6b63cbc7-51f1-4cf6-aa37-\
aa1ca09889fd"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "ThickFlasherDevelopabilityExcess[",
 StyleBox["tobj",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "]"
}], "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.912427563948533*^9, 3.912427577708064*^9}, {
  3.912452519761147*^9, 
  3.912452521688259*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2d2c2767-5ad5-4d31-b371-\
bbec052bd021"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "ThickFlasherDevelopabilityExcess[",
 StyleBox["tobj",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "] constructs a list of the developability excess for all of the vertices of \
the embedded zero-thickness surface of a thick flasher computed by \
MakeThickFlasher. Boundary vertices have a developability excess of zero by \
definition."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.912427594219253*^9, 
  3.912427638686499*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1ad9b029-080f-46d3-acb1-\
ffee02fc0f29"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Arguments:\n\t",
 StyleBox["tobj",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " \[LongDash] a TGraph3DAssigned returned by MakeThickFlasher."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.912453166178551*^9, 
  3.912453187664131*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"708c203a-bffe-44ae-bfab-\
90de61491b45"],

Cell["\<\
Returns: a list of the developability excess in radians for all vertices.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.912453190187945*^9, 
  3.91245320841369*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"12694962-65be-49d1-af6f-\
b2ca8e8c5a63"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ThickFlasherDevelopabilityExcess", "[", "tobj_TObj", "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"verts3d", ",", "iverts", ",", "vva", ",", "devex"}], "}"}], ",",
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"verts3d", ",", "iverts", ",", "vva"}], "}"}], "=", 
      RowBox[{"GetValues", "[", 
       RowBox[{"tobj", ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
         "Vertices3D", ",", "InteriorVertices", ",", 
          "VertexVertexAdjacency"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"devex", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
       RowBox[{"0", ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"Length", "[", "verts3d", "]"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"Do", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"devex", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", 
          RowBox[{
          "iverts", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "i", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], 
          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "=", 
         RowBox[{"DevelopabilityExcess3D", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"verts3d", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", 
            RowBox[{
            "iverts", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "i", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], 
            "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"verts3d", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", 
            RowBox[{"vva", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", 
             RowBox[{
             "iverts", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "i", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}],
              "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "]"}]}],
         ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", ",", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"i", ",", 
         RowBox[{"Length", "[", "iverts", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", "devex"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.912427644188508*^9, 3.912427671090423*^9}, {
  3.91245200627267*^9, 3.912452007262127*^9}, {3.912452039243505*^9, 
  3.912452094229308*^9}, {3.912452181477401*^9, 3.912452498140061*^9}, {
  3.912452533292201*^9, 3.912452536329859*^9}, {3.912452613258543*^9, 
  3.912452721718482*^9}, {3.912452805441602*^9, 3.912452840263636*^9}, {
  3.912452881442988*^9, 3.912452898828247*^9}, {3.912452935810155*^9, 
  3.912452947528102*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[4496]:=",ExpressionUUID->"0d568f5c-704e-4c91-933c-fb9f8bc6da8a"],

Cell["\<\
Example. Developability excess (in degrees) for all vertices.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.912427676307974*^9, 3.912427677294215*^9}, {
  3.912453062409167*^9, 3.912453072607423*^9}, {3.913552582787203*^9, 
