Cell["\<\
Example. Here are some deployed forms, superimposing the DP EZT surface. \
Observe that this is a check on the isometry between the stowed and deployed \
forms, because the way we constructed the deployed form was to translate and \
rotate all of the panels of the stowed form. They end up touching each other \
along the edges that are supposed to touch and then end up with top and \
bottom surfaces flat and planar (subject to edge trimming, of course).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.913479769242432*^9, 3.913479778828116*^9}, {
  3.913479948087216*^9, 3.913480005011924*^9}, {3.913480184474747*^9, 
  3.9134802224998813`*^9}, {3.913480322381196*^9, 3.913480347669507*^9}, {
  3.913553664251584*^9, 
  3.913553734803452*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5b1f2bda-5d32-4588-ac69-\
7824077674bc"],

