Cell["\<\
Example showing effects of FlasherScale, PanelClearance, and \
FlasherCentralExtraInset\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.913984556800262*^9, 3.91398456348895*^9}, {
   3.913984671370853*^9, 3.913984682226639*^9}, {3.9158039644083138`*^9, 
