Cell["\<\
Note that this works for either stowed or deployed form output of \
MakeThickFlasherPanels. We can detect whether the pattern is stowed or \
deployed from the structure of the triangle faces, which differ due to the \
different panel insetting that happens in MakeThickFlasherPanels.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9335120079004097`*^9, 
  3.933512078038281*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bdb839ab-5970-40ec-baec-\
9e156bcc0829"],

