Cell["\<\
Same example, but now adding the hinges to the deployed form. Note that we \
can use HingeJoinPanels, rather than ThickFlasherStowedHingeJoinPanels, for \
the deployed form and we don\[CloseCurlyQuote]t have to trim the triangle \
panels.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.912005706338274*^9, 3.912005707144905*^9}, 
