Cell["\<\
But we can trim the triangle panels if we want to have something close to the \
stowed form (for which trimming was necessary).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.933517364516891*^9, 
  3.933517396009975*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4d43c967-af9f-4a41-ae81-\
